(167002, 9408, 1143, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition. The fence is a great help in breaking up the vertical lines. Did you try using an even slower shutter speed? This is a great waterfall for photography! You''re lucky if you live near enough to go back. One of my favorites in this composition. ~indigo997</td>', 'Lovely composition. The fence is a great help in breaking up the vertical lines. Did you try using an even slower shutter speed? This is a great waterfall for photography! You''re lucky if you live near enough to go back. One of my favorites in this composition. ~indigo997', '2002-12-09 00:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
