(167086, 9408, 2923, '<td valign="top">There are some real possibilities with this image.  I wonder if there are other possible angles, even though the tree, the water fall and the rock on the left makes it a very nicely balanced image, the branches on top distorted the line of the waterfall.  I''d perhaps move closer to the fence and try to use the branches as a complement rather than a distorting element in the photograph.  Still, very nice photograph.  9 paganini</td>', 'There are some real possibilities with this image.  I wonder if there are other possible angles, even though the tree, the water fall and the rock on the left makes it a very nicely balanced image, the branches on top distorted the line of the waterfall.  I''d perhaps move closer to the fence and try to use the branches as a complement rather than a distorting element in the photograph.  Still, very nice photograph.  9 paganini', '2002-12-09 01:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
