(167212, 9499, 3084, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I can not even skip a stone, let alone capture such a great motion shot as this one.  Good luck.</td>', 'Great shot.  I can not even skip a stone, let alone capture such a great motion shot as this one.  Good luck.', '2002-12-09 05:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(167213, 9490, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great DOF, good capture of motion and  culture. Good exposure.<br/>Might have been a bit better composition wise concerning the guy in the foreground.</td>', 'Great DOF, good capture of motion and  culture. Good exposure.Might have been a bit better composition wise concerning the guy in the foreground.', '2002-12-09 05:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(167214, 9461, 3032, '<td valign="top">Save it at a higher compression quality next time. The quality of this picture is ruined by jpeg artefacts, not surprising given the 12kb filesize. The limit is 150kb, there is no reason to ruin your entry by compressing it so badly. <br/>There is something about this in the Tutorials I think.</td>', 'Save it at a higher compression quality next time. The quality of this picture is ruined by jpeg artefacts, not surprising given the 12kb filesize. The limit is 150kb, there is no reason to ruin your entry by compressing it so badly. There is something about this in the Tutorials I think.', '2002-12-09 06:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(167217, 9453, 3032, '<td valign="top">Good panning. A lot better than all those blurred subject, frozen background photo''s.</td>', 'Good panning. A lot better than all those blurred subject, frozen background photo''s.', '2002-12-09 06:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(167218, 9438, 3032, '<td valign="top">A bit overexposed, and unfortunately the CCD seems to be unable to handle reflections at the base of the fall. When possible, you might want to try a polarizer with this kind of shots.</td>', 'A bit overexposed, and unfortunately the CCD seems to be unable to handle reflections at the base of the fall. When possible, you might want to try a polarizer with this kind of shots.', '2002-12-09 06:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(167226, 9295, 4510, '<td valign="top">Great shot, It really fits the challenge and is beautifully lit.</td>', 'Great shot, It really fits the challenge and is beautifully lit.', '2002-12-09 06:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(167227, 9334, 4615, '<td valign="top">I like the whole concept.  On the critical sdie, thwere seems to be a distorted perspective effect, perhabs caused by cropping?</td>', 'I like the whole concept.  On the critical sdie, thwere seems to be a distorted perspective effect, perhabs caused by cropping?', '2002-12-09 06:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(167228, 9542, 4510, '<td valign="top">I was expecting a lot of open shutter night time shots of traffic in this challenge. But what you''ve captured here is truly spectacular. great shot and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I was expecting a lot of open shutter night time shots of traffic in this challenge. But what you''ve captured here is truly spectacular. great shot and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-09 06:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(167230, 9374, 4615, '<td valign="top">great idea.  I would recommend having the metronome at less of an angel to the viewer,</td>', 'great idea.  I would recommend having the metronome at less of an angel to the viewer,', '2002-12-09 06:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(167231, 9466, 5364, '<td valign="top">Yours is the best of the egg pictures</td>', 'Yours is the best of the egg pictures', '2002-12-09 06:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(167232, 9416, 3735, '<td valign="top">good photo if it had been ( Fliped)</td>', 'good photo if it had been ( Fliped)', '2002-12-09 07:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(167233, 9328, 4077, '<td valign="top">Hmm... it''s a nice image, but the evidence of the hand used to knock over the king is all too present. (Then again, you may have wanted it like this.) However, I''d have thought it would have been better to tie some fishing line around the king and pull it over mid-exposure instead of using a hand.</td>', 'Hmm... it''s a nice image, but the evidence of the hand used to knock over the king is all too present. (Then again, you may have wanted it like this.) However, I''d have thought it would have been better to tie some fishing line around the king and pull it over mid-exposure instead of using a hand.', '2002-12-09 07:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(167234, 9316, 5364, '<td valign="top">This is good. You have managed to get just enough blur into the snow to give the feeling of movement.</td>', 'This is good. You have managed to get just enough blur into the snow to give the feeling of movement.', '2002-12-09 07:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(167235, 9307, 4510, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and concept, excellent use of DOF, great shot.</td>', 'Good lighting and concept, excellent use of DOF, great shot.', '2002-12-09 07:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(167236, 9427, 4077, '<td valign="top">Whilst there''s nothing wrong with this, I''d have thought it might had made for a more interesting shot if you''d used a 3/4 from behind perspective.</td>', 'Whilst there''s nothing wrong with this, I''d have thought it might had made for a more interesting shot if you''d used a 3/4 from behind perspective.', '2002-12-09 07:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(167237, 9484, 4077, '<td valign="top">Excellent image - I really like the warm tones in this shot. It also fits the challenge perfectly.</td>', 'Excellent image - I really like the warm tones in this shot. It also fits the challenge perfectly.', '2002-12-09 07:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(167238, 9352, 4615, '<td valign="top">I would have used a long-ways shot here, to show more of the chain and not cut off the top.  Also, this would fill the picture more and leave out more of the blank wall.</td>', 'I would have used a long-ways shot here, to show more of the chain and not cut off the top.  Also, this would fill the picture more and leave out more of the blank wall.', '2002-12-09 07:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(167239, 9514, 4077, '<td valign="top">Nice image. I like the contrast between the sunlit areas and the areas in shadow. Well captured.</td>', 'Nice image. I like the contrast between the sunlit areas and the areas in shadow. Well captured.', '2002-12-09 07:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(167240, 9261, 5364, '<td valign="top">The sense of forward motion is impressive.</td>', 'The sense of forward motion is impressive.', '2002-12-09 07:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(167241, 9581, 4077, '<td valign="top">Hmm... nice shot/concept. That said, it would be more effective if the chap in the cowboy hat had stayed perfectly still. (Pesky humans, etc.)</td>', 'Hmm... nice shot/concept. That said, it would be more effective if the chap in the cowboy hat had stayed perfectly still. (Pesky humans, etc.)', '2002-12-09 07:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(167242, 9404, 4510, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, very well shot, you''ve created a great effect.</td>', 'Interesting subject, very well shot, you''ve created a great effect.', '2002-12-09 07:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(167243, 9279, 4615, '<td valign="top">I really like the alternative take on the challenge.  It looks a little buzy, try selecting one or two of the prints and focusing on them.</td>', 'I really like the alternative take on the challenge.  It looks a little buzy, try selecting one or two of the prints and focusing on them.', '2002-12-09 07:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(167244, 9580, 4077, '<td valign="top">Whilst it clearly depicts motion, the problem is that to the casual observer (ie: me), it''s impossible to tell what''s actually been captured.</td>', 'Whilst it clearly depicts motion, the problem is that to the casual observer (ie: me), it''s impossible to tell what''s actually been captured.', '2002-12-09 07:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(167247, 9294, 4077, '<td valign="top">Ahh.. decided not to go for the Scalextrix then. ;-) Excellent image though (more effective as well).</td>', 'Ahh.. decided not to go for the Scalextrix then. ;-) Excellent image though (more effective as well).', '2002-12-09 07:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(167248, 9576, 4077, '<td valign="top">Way too much motion. (Nice as an abstract, but impossible to tell what''s actually going on.)</td>', 'Way too much motion. (Nice as an abstract, but impossible to tell what''s actually going on.)', '2002-12-09 07:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
