(167263, 9528, 4077, '<td valign="top">Nice play on words. ;-) The image is also pretty good, but marred (for me at least) by the way the base thingy (whatever the name is for what the hammer hits) isn''t in perfect focus.</td>', 'Nice play on words. ;-) The image is also pretty good, but marred (for me at least) by the way the base thingy (whatever the name is for what the hammer hits) isn''t in perfect focus.', '2002-12-09 07:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
