(167476, 9263, 327, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. Good composition, good color, good action &lt;motion&gt;. The focus is too soft. My guess this is handheld. The shake. Would of been better if crisp. That is the only negative thing I can say the rest is very good.</td>', 'Very pretty. Good composition, good color, good action <motion>. The focus is too soft. My guess this is handheld. The shake. Would of been better if crisp. That is the only negative thing I can say the rest is very good.', '2002-12-09 10:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
