(167478, 9295, 4077, '<td valign="top">This could well have been an amazing shot, but it''s just too bright in terms of the background. (It detracts from the glow of the sparks if you know what I mean.)</td>', 'This could well have been an amazing shot, but it''s just too bright in terms of the background. (It detracts from the glow of the sparks if you know what I mean.)', '2002-12-09 10:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
