(167515, 9520, 3294, '<td valign="top">I changed this vote from an 8 to a 9... this is very nice.  If I were forced to cahnge something I might have had her wear a yellow shirt.... to give a sun-like effect... or maybe wear some fake tattoos on her arms to give more character to the fluttering arms... actually nevermind me, I''m rambling.  :D</td>', 'I changed this vote from an 8 to a 9... this is very nice.  If I were forced to cahnge something I might have had her wear a yellow shirt.... to give a sun-like effect... or maybe wear some fake tattoos on her arms to give more character to the fluttering arms... actually nevermind me, I''m rambling.  :D', '2002-12-09 11:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(167526, 9520, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is very "Thai" - love the shapes and symmetry. And the darkness surrounding her. I''d like more crop below and more included at top.</td>', 'This is very "Thai" - love the shapes and symmetry. And the darkness surrounding her. I''d like more crop below and more included at top.', '2002-12-09 11:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(167535, 9508, 2302, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of motion, I like that the girl is captured in the mirror. And I am glad that you didn''t get your own reflection in the mirror as many people seem to do when taking this kind of shot. My only comment is that the shot seems to tilt to the left - although in a weird way that adds to the motion seen in the shot. 7</td>', 'Nice capture of motion, I like that the girl is captured in the mirror. And I am glad that you didn''t get your own reflection in the mirror as many people seem to do when taking this kind of shot. My only comment is that the shot seems to tilt to the left - although in a weird way that adds to the motion seen in the shot. 7', '2002-12-09 11:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(167550, 9576, 5250, '<td valign="top">This picture looks like a blob. You can not make out anything, and thus I do not see anything to do with movement. If there was a shopping cart in this photo I would of liked to have seen it!</td>', 'This picture looks like a blob. You can not make out anything, and thus I do not see anything to do with movement. If there was a shopping cart in this photo I would of liked to have seen it!', '2002-12-09 11:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(167552, 9525, 3087, '<td valign="top">Very Lord of the Rings... :)<br/>A little too dark and the very long shutter has actually meant loss of motion towards bottom of frame, though it''s captured the waterfall area well.</td>', 'Very Lord of the Rings... :)A little too dark and the very long shutter has actually meant loss of motion towards bottom of frame, though it''s captured the waterfall area well.', '2002-12-09 11:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(167554, 9498, 5250, '<td valign="top">If the moving players were a little less blurred than they are (I know that you were trying to blur them) then I would of scored you slightly higher. jgillard6</td>', 'If the moving players were a little less blurred than they are (I know that you were trying to blur them) then I would of scored you slightly higher. jgillard6', '2002-12-09 11:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
