(167623, 9348, 5250, '<td valign="top">The photo is a little tight (meaning I think you tried to crap too much into a small space). It is because of this that the photo looks like some blurry animals standing around. If  this photo was taken from another angle, where I could maybe see them moving towards a door, I would of scored higher. jgillard3</td>', 'The photo is a little tight (meaning I think you tried to crap too much into a small space). It is because of this that the photo looks like some blurry animals standing around. If  this photo was taken from another angle, where I could maybe see them moving towards a door, I would of scored higher. jgillard3', '2002-12-09 11:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(167626, 9508, 5250, '<td valign="top">A slightly faster shutter speed would of given more defnition to the moving legs, and would of been better I think. jgillard5</td>', 'A slightly faster shutter speed would of given more defnition to the moving legs, and would of been better I think. jgillard5', '2002-12-09 11:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
