(168746, 9360, 4927, '<td valign="top">The color and detail is crisp and clear, and there is barely any noticeable noise in the background sky. It does look like the blur from the oncoming headlights in the left side of the photo is slightly overexposed and is a bit distracting. Overall, a very nice photo though.<br/> <br/>I do admit that I''m somewhat partial towards the photo because this city skyline seems strangely familiarIm actually going to school at Pitt; didnt know there were any other photographers from around here at DPC.<br/></td>', 'The color and detail is crisp and clear, and there is barely any noticeable noise in the background sky. It does look like the blur from the oncoming headlights in the left side of the photo is slightly overexposed and is a bit distracting. Overall, a very nice photo though. I do admit that I''m somewhat partial towards the photo because this city skyline seems strangely familiarIm actually going to school at Pitt; didnt know there were any other photographers from around here at DPC.', '2002-12-09 23:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
