(168928, 9544, 4514, '<td valign="top">This is intresting, but the only problem I can say is that I think it is a bit too busy. Too many suds.  I think I can get a bit confused looking at this because in some areas it does not look like suds, it looks like clouds reflecting in the water.</td>', 'This is intresting, but the only problem I can say is that I think it is a bit too busy. Too many suds.  I think I can get a bit confused looking at this because in some areas it does not look like suds, it looks like clouds reflecting in the water.', '2002-12-10 00:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(168930, 9407, 4267, '<td valign="top">damn those must be some big trees!</td>', 'damn those must be some big trees!', '2002-12-10 00:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(168931, 9542, 4514, '<td valign="top">This can be intresting.  I know you were trying for a wild look.  You achieved it.  I think there has to be something said for symetry here.  To me I do not think there is any.  Not too sure though.  Is that a reflection of something close to the center. If so what is it.  I would like to know because if I try to take a picture like this I would like to avoid that possible reflection.</td>', 'This can be intresting.  I know you were trying for a wild look.  You achieved it.  I think there has to be something said for symetry here.  To me I do not think there is any.  Not too sure though.  Is that a reflection of something close to the center. If so what is it.  I would like to know because if I try to take a picture like this I would like to avoid that possible reflection.', '2002-12-10 00:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(168937, 9487, 5625, '<td valign="top">Would have made a beautiful pan shot instead of a blur shot.</td>', 'Would have made a beautiful pan shot instead of a blur shot.', '2002-12-10 01:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
