(169020, 9498, 5158, '<td valign="top">Like how the player with the ball is sharp and how the motion of the others is captured towards the ball. Could have been framed a little better though. Still my favorit sports picture of this challenge.</td>', 'Like how the player with the ball is sharp and how the motion of the others is captured towards the ball. Could have been framed a little better though. Still my favorit sports picture of this challenge.', '2002-12-10 05:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(169021, 9456, 5158, '<td valign="top">Like the light very much. Thumb up</td>', 'Like the light very much. Thumb up', '2002-12-10 05:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(169022, 9502, 5158, '<td valign="top">Great idea and the exposure has been set right: not to long so the skaters ar not totally blurred.</td>', 'Great idea and the exposure has been set right: not to long so the skaters ar not totally blurred.', '2002-12-10 05:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(169023, 9533, 5158, '<td valign="top">Love it for it''s great idea. Also the light to the star-ship is set well.</td>', 'Love it for it''s great idea. Also the light to the star-ship is set well.', '2002-12-10 05:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(169024, 9408, 5158, '<td valign="top">Stands out compared to the many other waterfall pictures: this one is really loooong. One really moves the eyes all the way from the top to the bottom.</td>', 'Stands out compared to the many other waterfall pictures: this one is really loooong. One really moves the eyes all the way from the top to the bottom.', '2002-12-10 05:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(169027, 9442, 5158, '<td valign="top">Like it: exposure is set just right so the gras is not totally blurred. One almost feels the wind blow. Also like the light.</td>', 'Like it: exposure is set just right so the gras is not totally blurred. One almost feels the wind blow. Also like the light.', '2002-12-10 05:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(169028, 9344, 3540, '<td valign="top">Sky or ceiling is way washed out.  Unfortunately its really distracting to the pic. - Inspzil</td>', 'Sky or ceiling is way washed out.  Unfortunately its really distracting to the pic. - Inspzil', '2002-12-10 05:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(169029, 9349, 3942, '<td valign="top">This is a motion challenge and I will not vote very high on a shot, which fits to the challenge only by title. - 4</td>', 'This is a motion challenge and I will not vote very high on a shot, which fits to the challenge only by title. - 4', '2002-12-10 05:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(169031, 9461, 3942, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but why so small? Unfortunately the JPEG compression artefacts are destroying the impression. You used only 11,4 KB, but up to 150 KB are allowed by the rules! Doing so would have made your photo much more clearer... Nevertheless, good luck! -  nds</td>', 'Nice idea, but why so small? Unfortunately the JPEG compression artefacts are destroying the impression. You used only 11,4 KB, but up to 150 KB are allowed by the rules! Doing so would have made your photo much more clearer... Nevertheless, good luck! -  nds', '2002-12-10 05:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(169033, 9261, 3942, '<td valign="top">Congrats on this awesome shot. IMHO the motion blur level is perfect and you did the right decision with showing no additional car, bike or cockpit. I really like, how my eyes are guided into the depth of your shot by the white line. Your title is perfect too, I feel the adrenaline only by looking on your photo! 10 - nds</td>', 'Congrats on this awesome shot. IMHO the motion blur level is perfect and you did the right decision with showing no additional car, bike or cockpit. I really like, how my eyes are guided into the depth of your shot by the white line. Your title is perfect too, I feel the adrenaline only by looking on your photo! 10 - nds', '2002-12-10 05:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(169036, 9489, 3942, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition and the colours here. The "fixed" vertical lines of the inquiry kiosk are working great together with the well selected motion blur level of the train.  But there''s room for improvement too. IMHO a greater DOF wold make this shot better and clearer. I''d like to see the lamps and the paving tiles in a sharper focus. Did you used a tripod? The silhouette of a person, lazily leaned against the kiosk or waitig for the train on the track, would add the WOW. Nevertheless good luck for the challenge! (8)</td>', 'I really like the composition and the colours here. The "fixed" vertical lines of the inquiry kiosk are working great together with the well selected motion blur level of the train.  But there''s room for improvement too. IMHO a greater DOF wold make this shot better and clearer. I''d like to see the lamps and the paving tiles in a sharper focus. Did you used a tripod? The silhouette of a person, lazily leaned against the kiosk or waitig for the train on the track, would add the WOW. Nevertheless good luck for the challenge! (8)', '2002-12-10 06:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(169038, 9518, 3942, '<td valign="top">IMHO a blurred background and a sharp main subject would have been the better decision. You can achieve such an effect by moving the camera with the sledge while exposing. (5) nds</td>', 'IMHO a blurred background and a sharp main subject would have been the better decision. You can achieve such an effect by moving the camera with the sledge while exposing. (5) nds', '2002-12-10 06:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(169039, 9527, 2716, '<td valign="top">Ah man, you''re going to lose a lot of people here because of the title.  However, you''ll get alot of us Canadians drooling.  Execellent shot.  I love the mix of stationary and motion blur.  Cheers.     Jacko  9</td>', 'Ah man, you''re going to lose a lot of people here because of the title.  However, you''ll get alot of us Canadians drooling.  Execellent shot.  I love the mix of stationary and motion blur.  Cheers.     Jacko  9', '2002-12-10 06:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
