(169172, 9357, 4514, '<td valign="top">This is a better angle than the other drop that I saw on this challenge.   One queston remains.  Why is the Picture grainy. Did you crop it a lot then resize it too big??   The composition of the shot overall is pleasing to the eye.</td>', 'This is a better angle than the other drop that I saw on this challenge.   One queston remains.  Why is the Picture grainy. Did you crop it a lot then resize it too big??   The composition of the shot overall is pleasing to the eye.', '2002-12-10 11:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(169174, 9528, 4514, '<td valign="top">I would like to know the shutter speed here.  The base is slightly out of focus but when you do a macro shot like this you do not have that much to work with DOF wise.  Good job of getting the Gavel in focus on its way down.  Good shot.</td>', 'I would like to know the shutter speed here.  The base is slightly out of focus but when you do a macro shot like this you do not have that much to work with DOF wise.  Good job of getting the Gavel in focus on its way down.  Good shot.', '2002-12-10 11:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(169176, 9311, 4514, '<td valign="top">Now this is something different.  Good job of getting in the shade to take this one.  Most people are out in the sun when they try this in the rear view mirror.  The thing here is you have Focus and non focus presented in a slighty different way.<br/>Not a bad picture.</td>', 'Now this is something different.  Good job of getting in the shade to take this one.  Most people are out in the sun when they try this in the rear view mirror.  The thing here is you have Focus and non focus presented in a slighty different way.Not a bad picture.', '2002-12-10 11:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(169177, 9281, 4514, '<td valign="top">Was it raining out?  There almost seems to be a sense of fluid in the picture.  There is a lot of distraction in this shot.  Question remains.  What is the focal point.  Is there one.  It would have been intresting to really get the Hood ornament in good focus while the rest is blurred but when you are moving and you are using a shutter delay that would prove to be a problem.</td>', 'Was it raining out?  There almost seems to be a sense of fluid in the picture.  There is a lot of distraction in this shot.  Question remains.  What is the focal point.  Is there one.  It would have been intresting to really get the Hood ornament in good focus while the rest is blurred but when you are moving and you are using a shutter delay that would prove to be a problem.', '2002-12-10 11:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(169179, 9375, 4514, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  This is a great shot.  I think the Quality of the color of the paper is somewhat blotchy causeing this shot to look blurry or for a better word grainy.  maybe it is just my screen.</td>', 'Very nice.  This is a great shot.  I think the Quality of the color of the paper is somewhat blotchy causeing this shot to look blurry or for a better word grainy.  maybe it is just my screen.', '2002-12-10 11:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(169182, 9484, 4514, '<td valign="top">This is a cool shot.  But I think it would have been better to remove the light out of view.  I think it proves for a distraction since the eye naturally moves to the brightest part of the picture first.  The intresting thing here is that the rocking chair is not in the refection of the Mirror.  This is a nice eshot.   This is a nice shot Keep up the good work.</td>', 'This is a cool shot.  But I think it would have been better to remove the light out of view.  I think it proves for a distraction since the eye naturally moves to the brightest part of the picture first.  The intresting thing here is that the rocking chair is not in the refection of the Mirror.  This is a nice eshot.   This is a nice shot Keep up the good work.', '2002-12-10 11:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(169188, 9351, 4514, '<td valign="top">YOru composition is not bad here.  You managed to pit the horizon on the top line.  I assume the focal point is the Rock on the bottom left third intersection.  There is a decent blur to the motion of the water.  It is pleasent and not distracting.  The only thing I would assume to have a problem with is the amount of light.  Overall the shot is a decent shot.</td>', 'YOru composition is not bad here.  You managed to pit the horizon on the top line.  I assume the focal point is the Rock on the bottom left third intersection.  There is a decent blur to the motion of the water.  It is pleasent and not distracting.  The only thing I would assume to have a problem with is the amount of light.  Overall the shot is a decent shot.', '2002-12-10 11:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(169219, 9479, 1005, '<td valign="top">Great stopped motion!  The background is slightly blurred, not a bad thing, at first, I hated the grey sky, but you''re not god and can''t control the weather.  The bike rider is stopped so well!  First class work!  O.K. a 10!  Swash</td>', 'Great stopped motion!  The background is slightly blurred, not a bad thing, at first, I hated the grey sky, but you''re not god and can''t control the weather.  The bike rider is stopped so well!  First class work!  O.K. a 10!  Swash', '2002-12-10 12:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
