(169389, 9403, 472, '<td valign="top">i love florida.  this was prolly a hard shot to take, tho.  i wish it werent quite so blurred and from the back</td>', 'i love florida.  this was prolly a hard shot to take, tho.  i wish it werent quite so blurred and from the back', '2002-12-10 15:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(169391, 9572, 472, '<td valign="top">good composition, colors and action</td>', 'good composition, colors and action', '2002-12-10 15:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(169392, 9563, 472, '<td valign="top">i like the idea a lot</td>', 'i like the idea a lot', '2002-12-10 15:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(169394, 9321, 472, '<td valign="top">fish? not sure what im seeing</td>', 'fish? not sure what im seeing', '2002-12-10 15:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(169395, 9532, 2295, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  You get my vote for best this time.  waltoml 10</td>', 'Very nice.  You get my vote for best this time.  waltoml 10', '2002-12-10 15:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(169396, 9535, 2000, '<td valign="top">I can see the motion - is the stationary marble the one that hit the others?  In looking at this, I wonder what the left half of this pic is showing - I see the trail of what I guess is another marble, but it''s so dark it''s hard to tell.  Good effort.</td>', 'I can see the motion - is the stationary marble the one that hit the others?  In looking at this, I wonder what the left half of this pic is showing - I see the trail of what I guess is another marble, but it''s so dark it''s hard to tell.  Good effort.', '2002-12-10 15:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(169398, 9525, 472, '<td valign="top">GORGEOUS.  the water looks like molten metal in the foreground.  awesome shot and the focus and dof couldnt be better :)</td>', 'GORGEOUS.  the water looks like molten metal in the foreground.  awesome shot and the focus and dof couldnt be better :)', '2002-12-10 15:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(169399, 9414, 2295, '<td valign="top">This is great.  I love the exposure on this one.  Great focus too.  10 waltoml.<br/></td>', 'This is great.  I love the exposure on this one.  Great focus too.  10 waltoml.', '2002-12-10 15:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(169400, 9456, 472, '<td valign="top">great machine shot .. would have been good in technology too.  i like the light.</td>', 'great machine shot .. would have been good in technology too.  i like the light.', '2002-12-10 15:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(169401, 9349, 2295, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  Not too much motion though.  9 waltoml.</td>', 'Very pretty.  Not too much motion though.  9 waltoml.', '2002-12-10 15:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(169405, 9525, 2295, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo.  Great focus.  Lighting looks good.  I''d like to see this in color..  8 waltoml.</td>', 'Very nice photo.  Great focus.  Lighting looks good.  I''d like to see this in color..  8 waltoml.', '2002-12-10 15:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(169406, 9426, 2295, '<td valign="top">Very interesting photo.  Really meets the challenge.  8 waltoml.</td>', 'Very interesting photo.  Really meets the challenge.  8 waltoml.', '2002-12-10 15:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(169407, 9377, 4536, '<td valign="top">This looks like the dog that was mistakenly entered in the technology contest.<br/>Good motion shot, I can feel him running. Wish it were bigger, it''s hard to critique a photo that is so small.</td>', 'This looks like the dog that was mistakenly entered in the technology contest.Good motion shot, I can feel him running. Wish it were bigger, it''s hard to critique a photo that is so small.', '2002-12-10 15:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(169408, 9295, 2295, '<td valign="top">Good Job!!  I like this one.  8 waltoml.</td>', 'Good Job!!  I like this one.  8 waltoml.', '2002-12-10 15:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(169409, 9499, 2295, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Did you only get 1 skip?  Focus and lighting are very good.  Certainly meets the challenge.  9 waltoml.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Did you only get 1 skip?  Focus and lighting are very good.  Certainly meets the challenge.  9 waltoml.', '2002-12-10 15:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(169410, 9524, 2295, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  Focus and lighting are good.  subject matter is appropriate and interesting.  7 waltoml.</td>', 'Nice photo.  Focus and lighting are good.  subject matter is appropriate and interesting.  7 waltoml.', '2002-12-10 15:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
