(169412, 9492, 2295, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect.  Nice lighting and focus.  Subject matter is interesting and appropriate.  8 waltoml.</td>', 'Interesting effect.  Nice lighting and focus.  Subject matter is interesting and appropriate.  8 waltoml.', '2002-12-10 15:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(169413, 9375, 2295, '<td valign="top">Focus and lighting are good.  Subject matter is interesting.  Really meets the challenge. 8 waltoml.</td>', 'Focus and lighting are good.  Subject matter is interesting.  Really meets the challenge. 8 waltoml.', '2002-12-10 15:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(169416, 9338, 2295, '<td valign="top">The pinwheels in the front are really out of focus and distracting.  Meets the challenge though.  6 waltoml.</td>', 'The pinwheels in the front are really out of focus and distracting.  Meets the challenge though.  6 waltoml.', '2002-12-10 15:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(169417, 9279, 2295, '<td valign="top">Focus isn''t really very consistant.  Lighting is OK.  6 waltoml.</td>', 'Focus isn''t really very consistant.  Lighting is OK.  6 waltoml.', '2002-12-10 15:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(169418, 9581, 2295, '<td valign="top">Kind of an interesting idea.  Would have been better if the guy in the back was more in focus.  6 waltoml.</td>', 'Kind of an interesting idea.  Would have been better if the guy in the back was more in focus.  6 waltoml.', '2002-12-10 15:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(169419, 9576, 2295, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo.  Even with the title I can''t really identify what it is.  6 waltoml.</td>', 'Interesting photo.  Even with the title I can''t really identify what it is.  6 waltoml.', '2002-12-10 15:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(169420, 9478, 2295, '<td valign="top">Nice enough photo.  It''s a bit distracting to have the insides of the building be out of focus.  Were they moving?  6 waltoml.</td>', 'Nice enough photo.  It''s a bit distracting to have the insides of the building be out of focus.  Were they moving?  6 waltoml.', '2002-12-10 15:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(169421, 9314, 2295, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge.  Focus is off on the stationary objects.  6 waltoml.</td>', 'Meets the challenge.  Focus is off on the stationary objects.  6 waltoml.', '2002-12-10 15:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(169423, 9532, 3506, '<td valign="top">Excellent focus!  I love this shot, but for some reason I don''t get a sense of motion when I look at it.</td>', 'Excellent focus!  I love this shot, but for some reason I don''t get a sense of motion when I look at it.', '2002-12-10 15:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(169424, 9516, 3506, '<td valign="top">Quick!  Someone get a pin!</td>', 'Quick!  Someone get a pin!', '2002-12-10 15:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(169427, 9416, 3506, '<td valign="top">Uh, rota....Never mind....I''m sure you have 40+ comments on this one already......</td>', 'Uh, rota....Never mind....I''m sure you have 40+ comments on this one already......', '2002-12-10 15:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(169433, 9371, 5472, '<td valign="top">it''s a duck!</td>', 'it''s a duck!', '2002-12-10 16:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(169435, 9520, 4005, '<td valign="top">wow! The first 10 I gave for this challenge... KAOS</td>', 'wow! The first 10 I gave for this challenge... KAOS', '2002-12-10 16:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(169437, 9500, 573, '<td valign="top">Verysimplistic and very striking image, I feel you have captured the essence of the music.</td>', 'Verysimplistic and very striking image, I feel you have captured the essence of the music.', '2002-12-10 16:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(169441, 9560, 573, '<td valign="top">I think anyone who has ever had a child knows these moments all to well.  You have done an excelent job in capturing the movement of a child.</td>', 'I think anyone who has ever had a child knows these moments all to well.  You have done an excelent job in capturing the movement of a child.', '2002-12-10 16:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(169443, 9528, 573, '<td valign="top">Text book perfect!</td>', 'Text book perfect!', '2002-12-10 16:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(169445, 9404, 573, '<td valign="top">Very neat looking place. I would like to know where this is?</td>', 'Very neat looking place. I would like to know where this is?', '2002-12-10 16:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(169446, 9477, 573, '<td valign="top">Elegant in the simplicity.</td>', 'Elegant in the simplicity.', '2002-12-10 16:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(169451, 9398, 327, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot.....sure caught him (her) in the air. Good job. I think the composition could of been improved, but of course I usnderstand. Nice job.</td>', 'Not a bad shot.....sure caught him (her) in the air. Good job. I think the composition could of been improved, but of course I usnderstand. Nice job.', '2002-12-10 16:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(169454, 9425, 5121, '<td valign="top">Little bit on the blurry side. Try selecting a slower shutter speed (around 1 sec), also a bit of colour always looks best with these types of shots.</td>', 'Little bit on the blurry side. Try selecting a slower shutter speed (around 1 sec), also a bit of colour always looks best with these types of shots.', '2002-12-10 16:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(169455, 9525, 327, '<td valign="top">Stunning shot, great light, color, dof and action. Nice work.</td>', 'Stunning shot, great light, color, dof and action. Nice work.', '2002-12-10 16:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(169457, 9371, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. Good colors, light. Sadly he''s moving away....still the focus is very good as is the compositon.</td>', 'Nice capture. Good colors, light. Sadly he''s moving away....still the focus is very good as is the compositon.', '2002-12-10 16:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(169458, 9370, 5121, '<td valign="top">Nice hues.</td>', 'Nice hues.', '2002-12-10 16:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(169459, 9414, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice work. Good color, light.</td>', 'Nice work. Good color, light.', '2002-12-10 16:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(169467, 9484, 5121, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but the light bulb in the mirror draws my eye as does the cardigan draped on the cabinet. Nice touch with the Ted overseeing the rocking chair, but a little to busy overall.</td>', 'Good idea, but the light bulb in the mirror draws my eye as does the cardigan draped on the cabinet. Nice touch with the Ted overseeing the rocking chair, but a little to busy overall.', '2002-12-10 16:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(169469, 9375, 5121, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect. Is that a £2 coin? A fellow brit....</td>', 'Interesting effect. Is that a £2 coin? A fellow brit....', '2002-12-10 16:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(169470, 9442, 5121, '<td valign="top">Kinda interesting. Is this Cornwall, by chance?</td>', 'Kinda interesting. Is this Cornwall, by chance?', '2002-12-10 16:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(169471, 9357, 5121, '<td valign="top">Nice pic well frozen, excellent title!</td>', 'Nice pic well frozen, excellent title!', '2002-12-10 16:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(169472, 9435, 5121, '<td valign="top">Good shot, good colours. I like the way you can just make someone out inside the train.</td>', 'Good shot, good colours. I like the way you can just make someone out inside the train.', '2002-12-10 16:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(169473, 9487, 5121, '<td valign="top">Nice panorama. Think I''d have cropped out the grass and got a bit of a blur trailing behind that car leaving some superb colours in it''s wake.  Slower shutter.</td>', 'Nice panorama. Think I''d have cropped out the grass and got a bit of a blur trailing behind that car leaving some superb colours in it''s wake.  Slower shutter.', '2002-12-10 16:43:58.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(169476, 9461, 5121, '<td valign="top">Good choice to shoot BW. A bit sharper and a little more contrast needed tho''.  Good white border.</td>', 'Good choice to shoot BW. A bit sharper and a little more contrast needed tho''.  Good white border.', '2002-12-10 16:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(169477, 9296, 5121, '<td valign="top">This shot must''ve been a breeze...</td>', 'This shot must''ve been a breeze...', '2002-12-10 16:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(169481, 9429, 5121, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot! Nice metallic looking sheen on the colours.</td>', 'Excellent shot! Nice metallic looking sheen on the colours.', '2002-12-10 16:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(169486, 9302, 5548, '<td valign="top">Fuckin great photograph. To tell the truth I have never seen such a great piece of photography if I could Give it a 99999999999999999999999999999999 I would but ill stick to a 10 because thats as high as I can go. And also the other people who voted on this must be fuckin shit at voting because this is a fuckin 10.</td>', 'Fuckin great photograph. To tell the truth I have never seen such a great piece of photography if I could Give it a 99999999999999999999999999999999 I would but ill stick to a 10 because thats as high as I can go. And also the other people who voted on this must be fuckin shit at voting because this is a fuckin 10.', '2002-12-10 17:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(169501, 9268, 5508, '<td valign="top">Hi Phil.</td>', 'Hi Phil.', '2002-12-10 17:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(169503, 9357, 5508, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2002-12-10 17:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(169504, 9426, 5508, '<td valign="top">Awsome.</td>', 'Awsome.', '2002-12-10 17:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(169543, 9435, 4811, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition - good angle and lines. Would have been cool to have only the train blurry - The ceiling and platform would have been in nice with focus. What subway system is this? Look''s like Montreal''s.</td>', 'Very nice composition - good angle and lines. Would have been cool to have only the train blurry - The ceiling and platform would have been in nice with focus. What subway system is this? Look''s like Montreal''s.', '2002-12-10 18:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(169547, 9414, 4811, '<td valign="top">The lighting is simply beautiful! Was this light painted? Composition''s neat also but I think it would look pretty nice without the black top - makes a good abstract.</td>', 'The lighting is simply beautiful! Was this light painted? Composition''s neat also but I think it would look pretty nice without the black top - makes a good abstract.', '2002-12-10 18:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(169550, 9563, 4811, '<td valign="top">If it weren''t for the very white highlights, the blue horizontal lights and low photo quality (probably a camera limitation you couldn''t control), I think the photo would do nicely. Potential''s there.</td>', 'If it weren''t for the very white highlights, the blue horizontal lights and low photo quality (probably a camera limitation you couldn''t control), I think the photo would do nicely. Potential''s there.', '2002-12-10 18:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(169552, 9470, 4811, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, like the monotone-look of the image. Something''s casting a shadow on the right that doesn''t need to be there, but a very minor gripe.</td>', 'Nice composition, like the monotone-look of the image. Something''s casting a shadow on the right that doesn''t need to be there, but a very minor gripe.', '2002-12-10 18:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(169556, 9409, 4811, '<td valign="top">I like the placement of the ambulence in the lower corner, and the colors of the ambulence contrasts well with the bleak landscape. Background almost looks painted. Its unfortunate the ambulance isn''t in sharp focus. Not exactly sure why, maybe due to the autoamtic focus on the camera locking whatever is in the center of the frame (background)?</td>', 'I like the placement of the ambulence in the lower corner, and the colors of the ambulence contrasts well with the bleak landscape. Background almost looks painted. Its unfortunate the ambulance isn''t in sharp focus. Not exactly sure why, maybe due to the autoamtic focus on the camera locking whatever is in the center of the frame (background)?', '2002-12-10 18:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(169560, 9399, 4811, '<td valign="top">Wow, I wonder how you did that ring of ligght. Title really conveys the feal of the picture. The lighting needs to be a little lesh harsh on the angel, so that more of its form is not burned out. Overall though, pulled off very well.</td>', 'Wow, I wonder how you did that ring of ligght. Title really conveys the feal of the picture. The lighting needs to be a little lesh harsh on the angel, so that more of its form is not burned out. Overall though, pulled off very well.', '2002-12-10 19:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(169563, 9445, 4811, '<td valign="top">Very nice abstract, elements look sharp and really nice in blue. Undecided about the tree in the center. On one hand my eye sees it as a distraction as I try to look at the folloage, but nonetheless, the image seems less interesting without it. So I guess its best that its there :)</td>', 'Very nice abstract, elements look sharp and really nice in blue. Undecided about the tree in the center. On one hand my eye sees it as a distraction as I try to look at the folloage, but nonetheless, the image seems less interesting without it. So I guess its best that its there :)', '2002-12-10 19:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(169565, 9544, 4811, '<td valign="top">Composition''s a little messy with all those branches, but the water has a nice dreamy look to it and the muted colors together make an interesting image.</td>', 'Composition''s a little messy with all those branches, but the water has a nice dreamy look to it and the muted colors together make an interesting image.', '2002-12-10 19:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(169566, 9389, 4811, '<td valign="top">Nice candid. A couple of seconds later and the pole would have grown out of his head :) Must always be weary of bakground distractions. Though I know we''re supposed to depict motion, it would be nice to have the subject in focus.</td>', 'Nice candid. A couple of seconds later and the pole would have grown out of his head :) Must always be weary of bakground distractions. Though I know we''re supposed to depict motion, it would be nice to have the subject in focus.', '2002-12-10 19:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(169568, 9349, 4162, '<td valign="top">This is a really fantastic picture, the background and the pure white of the owl are great! However, I dont think that this shows motion......otherwise, i love it!</td>', 'This is a really fantastic picture, the background and the pure white of the owl are great! However, I dont think that this shows motion......otherwise, i love it!', '2002-12-10 19:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(169572, 9455, 4811, '<td valign="top">Really,really,  nice shot, composed well with no distractions. Subject dominates picture and in focus (the parts that need to be I suppose). And really does convey a feeling of motion. Only one suggestion - have you tried adjusting the image using levels or a similar editing tool to employ a full range of tones in your image? I tried it on the image and it really seems to bring out the colors. Cropping off the wood the bird is sitting on puts the bird a little more off center and strengthens the composition, but that''s a little more personal and I think yours worked just fine.  After challenge is over I''d love to show you what I tried and hear your opinion :)</td>', 'Really,really,  nice shot, composed well with no distractions. Subject dominates picture and in focus (the parts that need to be I suppose). And really does convey a feeling of motion. Only one suggestion - have you tried adjusting the image using levels or a similar editing tool to employ a full range of tones in your image? I tried it on the image and it really seems to bring out the colors. Cropping off the wood the bird is sitting on puts the bird a little more off center and strengthens the composition, but that''s a little more personal and I think yours worked just fine.  After challenge is over I''d love to show you what I tried and hear your opinion :)', '2002-12-10 19:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(169581, 9371, 4553, '<td valign="top">Sorry but I''m pretty sure this is not a Swan.</td>', 'Sorry but I''m pretty sure this is not a Swan.', '2002-12-10 19:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(169658, 9564, 5237, '<td valign="top">gr8 photo... good luck!!! :) -barbara.</td>', 'gr8 photo... good luck!!! :) -barbara.', '2002-12-10 21:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(169748, 9468, 5268, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo. It is awesome!  Good job.  Cub</td>', 'I really like this photo. It is awesome!  Good job.  Cub', '2002-12-10 22:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(169760, 9581, 1584, '<td valign="top">I enjoy photos that tell a story. I really like photos that let me make up my own story.<br/>Well done!</td>', 'I enjoy photos that tell a story. I really like photos that let me make up my own story.Well done!', '2002-12-10 22:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(169767, 9532, 2567, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.', '2002-12-10 22:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(169777, 9562, 573, '<td valign="top">Less than half of your picture is displayed. Second try this session,  I will come back later in the week to try again.  Second day, second browser, only the top third of the picture loads.  Finaly, first try on a Mac, I see the full image.  I like this photo alot, has sort of a metalic look to it.</td>', 'Less than half of your picture is displayed. Second try this session,  I will come back later in the week to try again.  Second day, second browser, only the top third of the picture loads.  Finaly, first try on a Mac, I see the full image.  I like this photo alot, has sort of a metalic look to it.', '2002-12-10 23:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(169798, 9374, 4430, '<td valign="top">maybe some dramtic lighting and slight adjustment in angle would help this.  Looks like a light shooting out, I like.</td>', 'maybe some dramtic lighting and slight adjustment in angle would help this.  Looks like a light shooting out, I like.', '2002-12-10 23:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(169805, 9455, 4430, '<td valign="top">I like how the head is in perfect focus.</td>', 'I like how the head is in perfect focus.', '2002-12-10 23:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(169808, 9366, 4430, '<td valign="top">Neat idea, did you get any shots of it landing on the nail?</td>', 'Neat idea, did you get any shots of it landing on the nail?', '2002-12-10 23:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(169842, 9280, 4430, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been really good if the people wouldn''t have been standing in front of you.</td>', 'I think this would have been really good if the people wouldn''t have been standing in front of you.', '2002-12-10 23:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(169843, 9532, 5086, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot...  good luck.</td>', 'Very interesting shot...  good luck.', '2002-12-10 23:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(169847, 9267, 5086, '<td valign="top">Wow, you can even see the water sheeting...  I used to try and capture that motion up north, but never quite caught it with my old point and shoot!</td>', 'Wow, you can even see the water sheeting...  I used to try and capture that motion up north, but never quite caught it with my old point and shoot!', '2002-12-10 23:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(169849, 9300, 5086, '<td valign="top">My son used to play midnight ball all the time...  great shot...</td>', 'My son used to play midnight ball all the time...  great shot...', '2002-12-10 23:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(169852, 9564, 5086, '<td valign="top">I like the symmetry...</td>', 'I like the symmetry...', '2002-12-11 00:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(169853, 9514, 5086, '<td valign="top">I like it...  was taking similar shots recently, and can almost hear the sound again.  Good luck!</td>', 'I like it...  was taking similar shots recently, and can almost hear the sound again.  Good luck!', '2002-12-11 00:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(169854, 9311, 5086, '<td valign="top">Great idea!</td>', 'Great idea!', '2002-12-11 00:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
