(170003, 9479, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is a very good example of stopped movement.  It is very unfortunate that the sky was not blue, but of course you had no control over that.  I very much like the composition, the way the flags break up the forground and the motocyclist is moving into the photograph... gives him room to "move".</td>', 'This is a very good example of stopped movement.  It is very unfortunate that the sky was not blue, but of course you had no control over that.  I very much like the composition, the way the flags break up the forground and the motocyclist is moving into the photograph... gives him room to "move".', '2002-12-11 07:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(170004, 9341, 1024, '<td valign="top">Abstracts do not tend to do well in the challenges, but I like this one very much.  The vibrant colors against a black background is dynamic.  I also like your choice of color for the border, it adds alot to the composition.  There are two small places in the light pattern that appear a little too bright, it seems to be where the light stick was closest to the camera.</td>', 'Abstracts do not tend to do well in the challenges, but I like this one very much.  The vibrant colors against a black background is dynamic.  I also like your choice of color for the border, it adds alot to the composition.  There are two small places in the light pattern that appear a little too bright, it seems to be where the light stick was closest to the camera.', '2002-12-11 07:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
