(170195, 9581, 3087, '<td valign="top">Very artistic - like the hight contrast treatment and strong shadows.<br/>Feels much too grainy to me (though maybe this is deliberate?) and the wall behind is too bright.<br/>Interesting shot...<br/>8</td>', 'Very artistic - like the hight contrast treatment and strong shadows.Feels much too grainy to me (though maybe this is deliberate?) and the wall behind is too bright.Interesting shot...8', '2002-12-11 11:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(170202, 9261, 3087, '<td valign="top">I love the white paint curves on the road and the feeling of being enclosed and rushing through a quiet country road.<br/>8</td>', 'I love the white paint curves on the road and the feeling of being enclosed and rushing through a quiet country road.8', '2002-12-11 12:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(170205, 9489, 3087, '<td valign="top">Fabulous colours, reflections and movement. The light is just wonderful. I like the composition too with the vertical at the left to balance the converging horizontal lines of train and platform.<br/>Personally I''d crop a little off the top.<br/>8</td>', 'Fabulous colours, reflections and movement. The light is just wonderful. I like the composition too with the vertical at the left to balance the converging horizontal lines of train and platform.Personally I''d crop a little off the top.8', '2002-12-11 12:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(170207, 9517, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of movement and colour.<br/>Being a Brit I don''t have the attachment to any flag that the Americans do, let alone, of course, the US flag, but I do like this picture.<br/>A little dark and a little grainy but great shapes.<br/>8</td>', 'Nice capture of movement and colour.Being a Brit I don''t have the attachment to any flag that the Americans do, let alone, of course, the US flag, but I do like this picture.A little dark and a little grainy but great shapes.8', '2002-12-11 12:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
