(170241, 9511, 2490, '<td valign="top">Needs a little more zoom to eliminate some of the "sky" and show more motion.  Eliminating the ref on the right might have helped too.  Who won? :-)</td>', 'Needs a little more zoom to eliminate some of the "sky" and show more motion.  Eliminating the ref on the right might have helped too.  Who won? :-)', '2002-12-11 12:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(170245, 9349, 2490, '<td valign="top">Beautiful owl.  I wish there was actually some motion in the shot instead of just the title, though, because I really would like to score this higher.</td>', 'Beautiful owl.  I wish there was actually some motion in the shot instead of just the title, though, because I really would like to score this higher.', '2002-12-11 12:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(170248, 9328, 3294, '<td valign="top">Neato!  I had this as a 6, only because I think the colors are drab.  Woulda preferred a different table.  But I like the movement.  Looking for string, I am.  hehe... so I give ya a 7.  Technically some pieces look overexposed while others look underexposed.  Focus seems fair.  Framed well.  hmmmm... maybe if it were b/w?  I dunno.</td>', 'Neato!  I had this as a 6, only because I think the colors are drab.  Woulda preferred a different table.  But I like the movement.  Looking for string, I am.  hehe... so I give ya a 7.  Technically some pieces look overexposed while others look underexposed.  Focus seems fair.  Framed well.  hmmmm... maybe if it were b/w?  I dunno.', '2002-12-11 12:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(170251, 9492, 2490, '<td valign="top">The motion seems backward, like they are all standing up instead of all falling down, but that''s just a feature, not a problem!  8 nards656</td>', 'The motion seems backward, like they are all standing up instead of all falling down, but that''s just a feature, not a problem!  8 nards656', '2002-12-11 12:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
