(170435, 9429, 4514, '<td valign="top">1)Does the photo meet the theme? (3)<br/>2)Color:(6)<br/>3)Composition(7)<br/>4)Focus(6)<br/>5)Background(6)<br/>6)Lighting(7)<br/>7)Title Relavance: (3)<br/> <br/>Overall Score. 5.42 rounded to 5<br/> <br/>Commentary.<br/>This photo does not fit the challenge.  You missed the PhotoJourn two weeks ago.  This is actually  great photo and I would give this a 6 or 7 in a challenge it would fit into.  Title was a bit weak.  Those two things really hit the score hard.  I am sorry about that.  :-(<br/></td>', '1)Does the photo meet the theme? (3)2)Color:(6)3)Composition(7)4)Focus(6)5)Background(6)6)Lighting(7)7)Title Relavance: (3) Overall Score. 5.42 rounded to 5 Commentary.This photo does not fit the challenge.  You missed the PhotoJourn two weeks ago.  This is actually  great photo and I would give this a 6 or 7 in a challenge it would fit into.  Title was a bit weak.  Those two things really hit the score hard.  I am sorry about that.  :-(', '2002-12-11 17:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(170436, 9360, 5121, '<td valign="top">Superb shot. Excellent detail!</td>', 'Superb shot. Excellent detail!', '2002-12-11 17:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(170438, 9520, 4514, '<td valign="top">1)Does this Fit the Challenge? (8)<br/>2)Color:(7)<br/>3)Composition(7)<br/>4)Focus:(5)<br/>5)Background(7)<br/>6)Lighting(7)<br/>7)Does the Title fit Photo:(6)<br/> <br/>Overall Score 6.71 rounded to 7<br/> <br/>Commentary:<br/>You have done a very good Job here.  I like this shot.  Good Portrait and I will tell you why.  You take notice to the little things.  I like the fact that the back of the hands are not showing.  You broke the wrists at every stop.  Obviously you know Portraits.  The light could have been a little lighter but you did get your point across.  Wonderful.</td>', '1)Does this Fit the Challenge? (8)2)Color:(7)3)Composition(7)4)Focus:(5)5)Background(7)6)Lighting(7)7)Does the Title fit Photo:(6) Overall Score 6.71 rounded to 7 Commentary:You have done a very good Job here.  I like this shot.  Good Portrait and I will tell you why.  You take notice to the little things.  I like the fact that the back of the hands are not showing.  You broke the wrists at every stop.  Obviously you know Portraits.  The light could have been a little lighter but you did get your point across.  Wonderful.', '2002-12-11 17:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(170443, 9514, 4514, '<td valign="top">1)Does the Photo meet the challenge?(5)<br/>2)Color:(7)<br/>3)Composition(7)<br/>4)Focus(6)<br/>5)Background(5)<br/>6)Lighting(6)<br/>7)Title Relavance(6)<br/> <br/>Overall Score: 6<br/> <br/>Commentary:<br/>This is a good photo.  The color is good and the compositon is very good.  In a different Challenge I would have scored this a little better.  Only thing I can suggest is to get down a little furthur if you can.  I do not like this much of an angle.  Otherwise this is a good good shot.<br/></td>', '1)Does the Photo meet the challenge?(5)2)Color:(7)3)Composition(7)4)Focus(6)5)Background(5)6)Lighting(6)7)Title Relavance(6) Overall Score: 6 Commentary:This is a good photo.  The color is good and the compositon is very good.  In a different Challenge I would have scored this a little better.  Only thing I can suggest is to get down a little furthur if you can.  I do not like this much of an angle.  Otherwise this is a good good shot.', '2002-12-11 17:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
