(170526, 9557, 2716, '<td valign="top">I like the textured look of this shot.   Looks a little underexposed.  Might want to brighten it up a little with your editing software.  I like the fact there are so many people to look at ... could sit there and study the picture for 15 minutes, just looking a the different people and what they are wearing.  Good luck.  jacko  8</td>', 'I like the textured look of this shot.   Looks a little underexposed.  Might want to brighten it up a little with your editing software.  I like the fact there are so many people to look at ... could sit there and study the picture for 15 minutes, just looking a the different people and what they are wearing.  Good luck.  jacko  8', '2002-12-11 20:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
