(170681, 9408, 4811, '<td valign="top">Very nice subject matter. Mist adds a really nice touch. I like the composition of the waterfall and the trees (I like having both of them in the shot, they almost look identical), even the moss - its just the fence that bothers me - feels like a distraction and that it shouldn''t be part of the picture. I don''t know if another angle would have helped. Overall image has a slight blue cast. It does give the waterfall and its surroundings a mystical quality to it but the small blue cast doesn''t make the green colors in the trees or moss look quite right. Fence notwithstaning though, a pretty nice image.</td>', 'Very nice subject matter. Mist adds a really nice touch. I like the composition of the waterfall and the trees (I like having both of them in the shot, they almost look identical), even the moss - its just the fence that bothers me - feels like a distraction and that it shouldn''t be part of the picture. I don''t know if another angle would have helped. Overall image has a slight blue cast. It does give the waterfall and its surroundings a mystical quality to it but the small blue cast doesn''t make the green colors in the trees or moss look quite right. Fence notwithstaning though, a pretty nice image.', '2002-12-11 23:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(170682, 9429, 4811, '<td valign="top">Very ncie photo which probably would have done very well during the photojournalism challenge :) Though this is a stopped motion picture, I feel it conveys motion extremely well, the image is packed with energy, and composed well. Very nice shot!</td>', 'Very ncie photo which probably would have done very well during the photojournalism challenge :) Though this is a stopped motion picture, I feel it conveys motion extremely well, the image is packed with energy, and composed well. Very nice shot!', '2002-12-11 23:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
