(170690, 9516, 4811, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites this week. You could almost feel like she''s moving across the picture. Nicely composed and I like the desaturated look. My only gripes, and these are very minor, would have been, one, to see the right arm in its entirety and two, if some sort of lighting would eliminate the shadow under her left arm. But a really great photograph nonetheless!</td>', 'One of my favorites this week. You could almost feel like she''s moving across the picture. Nicely composed and I like the desaturated look. My only gripes, and these are very minor, would have been, one, to see the right arm in its entirety and two, if some sort of lighting would eliminate the shadow under her left arm. But a really great photograph nonetheless!', '2002-12-11 23:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
