(170965, 9363, 1005, '<td valign="top">I like this edit better than the DeviantArt version.  This is brighter and the color comes out better.  Very nice job!  I''ve seen quite a few concert photos, most don''t turn out very well, this did.  With minimal lighting, you stopped her hair in mid swing.  Mary looks very sharp and crisp.  I''m going with a 9 here, but might change my mind for a 10.  Very nice!  Swash</td>', 'I like this edit better than the DeviantArt version.  This is brighter and the color comes out better.  Very nice job!  I''ve seen quite a few concert photos, most don''t turn out very well, this did.  With minimal lighting, you stopped her hair in mid swing.  Mary looks very sharp and crisp.  I''m going with a 9 here, but might change my mind for a 10.  Very nice!  Swash', '2002-12-12 12:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(171051, 9302, 3087, '<td valign="top">Not enough to hold the interest and the dark area at the bottom doesn''t do anything for me. Definitely shows motion though.</td>', 'Not enough to hold the interest and the dark area at the bottom doesn''t do anything for me. Definitely shows motion though.', '2002-12-12 13:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
