(171108, 9387, 1280, '<td valign="top">Grreat job on a classic sort of pic.  This truck looks like it''s flying!  Very nice.  Color, and contrast are good, so is composition.</td>', 'Grreat job on a classic sort of pic.  This truck looks like it''s flying!  Very nice.  Color, and contrast are good, so is composition.', '2002-12-12 15:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
