(171290, 9363, 4388, '<td valign="top">the two lights above their heads sets the scene. this looks like it was difficult with the man farther back than the woman, making it hard to get both in focus with a wide aperature to get enough light. if you had the aperature wide open then there is not much more you could do to get them both in focus except move to where they both were about the same distance from the camera.  very nice shot, shows emotion and i can almost hear the beat and music.</td>', 'the two lights above their heads sets the scene. this looks like it was difficult with the man farther back than the woman, making it hard to get both in focus with a wide aperature to get enough light. if you had the aperature wide open then there is not much more you could do to get them both in focus except move to where they both were about the same distance from the camera.  very nice shot, shows emotion and i can almost hear the beat and music.', '2002-12-12 19:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(171297, 9562, 3018, '<td valign="top">Wow! Great texture of the water, it makes it look like some liquid metal.  Colors are great.  I think it would''ve benefit from some noise reduction.  Good luck!</td>', 'Wow! Great texture of the water, it makes it look like some liquid metal.  Colors are great.  I think it would''ve benefit from some noise reduction.  Good luck!', '2002-12-12 19:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
