(171310, 9332, 4388, '<td valign="top">creative. i like the framing with the two yellow handrails at the bottom and the tree and grass in the background going by. it would even have been better if you could have stretched the exposure longer to make the background spinning even more. i would have liked to have seen the girl not squinting. nice shot!</td>', 'creative. i like the framing with the two yellow handrails at the bottom and the tree and grass in the background going by. it would even have been better if you could have stretched the exposure longer to make the background spinning even more. i would have liked to have seen the girl not squinting. nice shot!', '2002-12-12 20:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(171314, 9428, 4388, '<td valign="top">i like the title and it probably was a tight race but i would have liked this photo better if there was more in it.  maybe from a different angle including some marker, the finish line boats, a bouy, or something.</td>', 'i like the title and it probably was a tight race but i would have liked this photo better if there was more in it.  maybe from a different angle including some marker, the finish line boats, a bouy, or something.', '2002-12-12 20:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(171315, 9524, 4388, '<td valign="top">very nice composition. i like the two student''s white legs facing the instructor''s black legs. the extra leg in the upper right is a little distracting. the toes lined up on  the left are what makes this photo. nice shot!</td>', 'very nice composition. i like the two student''s white legs facing the instructor''s black legs. the extra leg in the upper right is a little distracting. the toes lined up on  the left are what makes this photo. nice shot!', '2002-12-12 20:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(171320, 9404, 4388, '<td valign="top">this photo has good composition with the shiney surfaces and different colors surrounding the water. a lot going on but it fits together very well. the glass surfaces and the lines in the glass blocks all point to the water in the middle. i would like to have seen the water either stopped completely with a faster shutter speed or more soft and white with a longer shutter speed. the reason why is that the background of the picture, the glass blocks, are the point of focus because they are the things that are in focus.  just my opinion. excellent photograph.</td>', 'this photo has good composition with the shiney surfaces and different colors surrounding the water. a lot going on but it fits together very well. the glass surfaces and the lines in the glass blocks all point to the water in the middle. i would like to have seen the water either stopped completely with a faster shutter speed or more soft and white with a longer shutter speed. the reason why is that the background of the picture, the glass blocks, are the point of focus because they are the things that are in focus.  just my opinion. excellent photograph.', '2002-12-12 20:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(171321, 9370, 4388, '<td valign="top">interesting photograph. the apparent motion makes it look like the egg flipper may have been angry and was slamming the egg down into the pan. the oil bottles help set the scene. the bluish purple under the pan looks surreal. nice shot.</td>', 'interesting photograph. the apparent motion makes it look like the egg flipper may have been angry and was slamming the egg down into the pan. the oil bottles help set the scene. the bluish purple under the pan looks surreal. nice shot.', '2002-12-12 20:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(171322, 9474, 5023, '<td valign="top">Now thats how you do a waterfall.  I am shocked to see so meny people that dont know how to shoot moving water.  maybe this shot will drive that point home. vote +9</td>', 'Now thats how you do a waterfall.  I am shocked to see so meny people that dont know how to shoot moving water.  maybe this shot will drive that point home. vote +9', '2002-12-12 20:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(171323, 9565, 3080, '<td valign="top">That is a serious vertical jump on that dog.  He definately had to have been in motion.  The angle and framing/cropping are ok, maybe cropped just a tad close to the dog of the right.  The lighting is good, and your focus and clarity seen to be just fine to me as well.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'That is a serious vertical jump on that dog.  He definately had to have been in motion.  The angle and framing/cropping are ok, maybe cropped just a tad close to the dog of the right.  The lighting is good, and your focus and clarity seen to be just fine to me as well.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-12 20:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(171326, 9448, 3080, '<td valign="top">Definately motion.  It''s not a wow kind of image, but it is technically well done.  The color is good, and the lines are good too.  I think the angle and framing/cropping are alright. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Definately motion.  It''s not a wow kind of image, but it is technically well done.  The color is good, and the lines are good too.  I think the angle and framing/cropping are alright. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-12 20:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(171330, 9328, 3080, '<td valign="top">A very cool shot.  Definately showing the movement to take the piece.  I like the angle and framing/cropping as well.  The wood grain board looks good on the wood grain table, but the brown pieces kind of blend in a bit.  Otherwise, focus and clarity are good.  You have done a nice job. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'A very cool shot.  Definately showing the movement to take the piece.  I like the angle and framing/cropping as well.  The wood grain board looks good on the wood grain table, but the brown pieces kind of blend in a bit.  Otherwise, focus and clarity are good.  You have done a nice job. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-12 20:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(171335, 9518, 4615, '<td valign="top">I was going to submit a similar shot.  i''m glad I didn''t now, because your''s is much better.    Could crop it a little more to really focus on the tobaogganer.</td>', 'I was going to submit a similar shot.  i''m glad I didn''t now, because your''s is much better.    Could crop it a little more to really focus on the tobaogganer.', '2002-12-12 20:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
