(171460, 9261, 3724, '<td valign="top">i liked the way this pic came on screen so fast........   how did you do that?  I like the tunnel/valley effect created by the blurred tree lined road.  The WHITELINE on the road has a nice effect of floating above the road, and to me carries the most interest.   the sky brightness is harsh, but cropping it would have made a very long and lean picture....... but it might have been an option.</td>', 'i liked the way this pic came on screen so fast........   how did you do that?  I like the tunnel/valley effect created by the blurred tree lined road.  The WHITELINE on the road has a nice effect of floating above the road, and to me carries the most interest.   the sky brightness is harsh, but cropping it would have made a very long and lean picture....... but it might have been an option.', '2002-12-12 23:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
