(171606, 9525, 2780, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. I love the angle and perspective, and the really nice blue colour. The water looks so nice and smoothe from the movement. Great photo!</td>', 'Excellent shot. I love the angle and perspective, and the really nice blue colour. The water looks so nice and smoothe from the movement. Great photo!', '2002-12-13 02:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(171607, 9426, 2780, '<td valign="top">I really like how the front wheel is spinning (what looks like) really fast, but the back one is still. Nice effect</td>', 'I really like how the front wheel is spinning (what looks like) really fast, but the back one is still. Nice effect', '2002-12-13 02:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(171608, 9326, 2780, '<td valign="top">Really nice photo, but I think the tiny boarder kind of ruins it, but I''ll just judge on the photo. I think black and white was a great choice for this, but I think you should have darkened it a bit and added more contrast in PS, as at the moment the tones aren''t very vibrant. Still an 8 score though. Great work.</td>', 'Really nice photo, but I think the tiny boarder kind of ruins it, but I''ll just judge on the photo. I think black and white was a great choice for this, but I think you should have darkened it a bit and added more contrast in PS, as at the moment the tones aren''t very vibrant. Still an 8 score though. Great work.', '2002-12-13 02:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(171609, 9471, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is really good, but I can only really see the movement from the light streaks that show, I would have liked to have been able to see the actual trails of the balls a bit better. 8.</td>', 'This is really good, but I can only really see the movement from the light streaks that show, I would have liked to have been able to see the actual trails of the balls a bit better. 8.', '2002-12-13 02:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(171613, 9446, 917, '<td valign="top">Great use of a staic model in the foreground, but you could have done a bit more with it, like get a lower angle to help contrast the grey against the colours.</td>', 'Great use of a staic model in the foreground, but you could have done a bit more with it, like get a lower angle to help contrast the grey against the colours.', '2002-12-13 05:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(171614, 9267, 917, '<td valign="top">Horizon not level, but this is the best of the sea pics so far. Could get a bit lower to get the white breaking through the horizon a bit better, and could crop a bit more on the right.</td>', 'Horizon not level, but this is the best of the sea pics so far. Could get a bit lower to get the white breaking through the horizon a bit better, and could crop a bit more on the right.', '2002-12-13 05:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(171615, 9514, 917, '<td valign="top">In not getting with the border Im afraid. The pic is good, but the border just keeps drawing my eye.</td>', 'In not getting with the border Im afraid. The pic is good, but the border just keeps drawing my eye.', '2002-12-13 05:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(171616, 9426, 917, '<td valign="top">One of the better streaming light entries.</td>', 'One of the better streaming light entries.', '2002-12-13 05:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(171617, 9493, 917, '<td valign="top">A verticle format to show where its going next would help. There is too much dead space at the sides.</td>', 'A verticle format to show where its going next would help. There is too much dead space at the sides.', '2002-12-13 05:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(171618, 9574, 3540, '<td valign="top">The color on this is really drab.  It could use a little brightening and some boost of saturation.  I don''t like the way it''s framed either.  It goes uphill considerably from L to R. - Inspzil</td>', 'The color on this is really drab.  It could use a little brightening and some boost of saturation.  I don''t like the way it''s framed either.  It goes uphill considerably from L to R. - Inspzil', '2002-12-13 05:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(171619, 9271, 917, '<td valign="top">I think as this is already pretty blown out, the extra white space top and left dont really help.</td>', 'I think as this is already pretty blown out, the extra white space top and left dont really help.', '2002-12-13 05:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(171620, 9320, 917, '<td valign="top">Or up, even.</td>', 'Or up, even.', '2002-12-13 05:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(171621, 9533, 3540, '<td valign="top">NIce shot.  The tie fighter is really clear.  The motion is well captured, even though I  don''t think it''s moving.  Great job. - Inspzil</td>', 'NIce shot.  The tie fighter is really clear.  The motion is well captured, even though I  don''t think it''s moving.  Great job. - Inspzil', '2002-12-13 05:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
