(171623, 9428, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is a nice pic.  I''m not sure how well it depicts motion though.  I guess I''m expecting to see some wake or some other sign of either of the boats moving.  I see something in the water that might be on the left boat - Inspzil</td>', 'This is a nice pic.  I''m not sure how well it depicts motion though.  I guess I''m expecting to see some wake or some other sign of either of the boats moving.  I see something in the water that might be on the left boat - Inspzil', '2002-12-13 05:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
