(171756, 9516, 3080, '<td valign="top">I do belly dance too.  Great relaxation.  I like the motion of the cloth behind her. shows motion very nicely.  There are some dark spots throughout the photo.  I wonder what caused them.  There is one on her belly, a few on the cloth, some one the dark background.  They don''t really look like they are naturally occuring in the scene.  Otherwise, lighting is wonderful, angle and framing/cropping are ok.  I don''t think it is important to have the full cloth in the photo, however you did chop her hand off at the wrist.  minor detail.  I really like this photo.  best wishes to the new mama. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I do belly dance too.  Great relaxation.  I like the motion of the cloth behind her. shows motion very nicely.  There are some dark spots throughout the photo.  I wonder what caused them.  There is one on her belly, a few on the cloth, some one the dark background.  They don''t really look like they are naturally occuring in the scene.  Otherwise, lighting is wonderful, angle and framing/cropping are ok.  I don''t think it is important to have the full cloth in the photo, however you did chop her hand off at the wrist.  minor detail.  I really like this photo.  best wishes to the new mama. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-13 15:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
