(171834, 9314, 4267, '<td valign="top">I like th black and white here</td>', 'I like th black and white here', '2002-12-13 18:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(171835, 9455, 4267, '<td valign="top">very nice work.. good dof!!</td>', 'very nice work.. good dof!!', '2002-12-13 18:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(171836, 9357, 4267, '<td valign="top">nice capture....</td>', 'nice capture....', '2002-12-13 18:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(171872, 9500, 3540, '<td valign="top">Would''ve like to see a little more motion from this guy.  I bet he did move more but the camera didn''t pick it up quite as well as I would''ve liked.  Its a hell of a good idea.  I wish I''d a thunk it.  It does fit quite well in last weeks challenge, you gotta admit that KB.  It was also the very first photo I looked at voting this week, so that might have had something to do with why I thought it was leftover from last week. - Inspzil</td>', 'Would''ve like to see a little more motion from this guy.  I bet he did move more but the camera didn''t pick it up quite as well as I would''ve liked.  Its a hell of a good idea.  I wish I''d a thunk it.  It does fit quite well in last weeks challenge, you gotta admit that KB.  It was also the very first photo I looked at voting this week, so that might have had something to do with why I thought it was leftover from last week. - Inspzil', '2002-12-13 22:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(171881, 9562, 3080, '<td valign="top">there is definately motion here.  The photo seems grainy to me.  Otherwise, I like the anlge and framing/cropping you have chosen, and the motion is very clear and obvious.  Lighting conditions seem ok for the shot. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'there is definately motion here.  The photo seems grainy to me.  Otherwise, I like the anlge and framing/cropping you have chosen, and the motion is very clear and obvious.  Lighting conditions seem ok for the shot. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-13 22:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(171882, 9382, 3080, '<td valign="top">It looks like the surface of the moon or something.  Very strange.  I can see motion in the front, which looks like the road.  The photo seems a bit dark and doesn''t have much detail in the surroundings, but still interesting.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'It looks like the surface of the moon or something.  Very strange.  I can see motion in the front, which looks like the road.  The photo seems a bit dark and doesn''t have much detail in the surroundings, but still interesting.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-13 22:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(171883, 9577, 3080, '<td valign="top">Definately motion in this shot.  I love the rear tail propellor thingy.  The pilots are looking at you like you''re crazy. lol.  The color is very nice in this shot, expecially since it looks like an overcast day.  Angle and framing/cropping are good.  Nice shot. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Definately motion in this shot.  I love the rear tail propellor thingy.  The pilots are looking at you like you''re crazy. lol.  The color is very nice in this shot, expecially since it looks like an overcast day.  Angle and framing/cropping are good.  Nice shot. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-13 23:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(171884, 9414, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very very nice!  Love th emotion in this.  The water mixed with the snow and the lighting are really great together.  I like the angle and framign/cropping you have chosen for this.  Very nice.  The color is simply great.  Love the oranges.  Excelent focus and clarity. Definately motion. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very very nice!  Love th emotion in this.  The water mixed with the snow and the lighting are really great together.  I like the angle and framign/cropping you have chosen for this.  Very nice.  The color is simply great.  Love the oranges.  Excelent focus and clarity. Definately motion. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-13 23:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(171886, 9564, 3080, '<td valign="top">There are quite a few of this kind of shot in this challenge, but I think yours stands out as something special.  You have red white and blue, and even the stars.  It''s an abstract american flag!  An interesting shot.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'There are quite a few of this kind of shot in this challenge, but I think yours stands out as something special.  You have red white and blue, and even the stars.  It''s an abstract american flag!  An interesting shot.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-13 23:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(171892, 9525, 4811, '<td valign="top">It must be the slow shutter speed combined with the blue tone that makes the water look almost solid, like blue silly putty, but effect gives the photo an offwordly feel. Brook is also nicely lighted and exposed. I would have cropped the trees on top and just have the waterfall section. Might have been a stronger composition.</td>', 'It must be the slow shutter speed combined with the blue tone that makes the water look almost solid, like blue silly putty, but effect gives the photo an offwordly feel. Brook is also nicely lighted and exposed. I would have cropped the trees on top and just have the waterfall section. Might have been a stronger composition.', '2002-12-13 23:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(171893, 9520, 5044, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I love this. 10</td>', 'Great shot. I love this. 10', '2002-12-13 23:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(171894, 9514, 4811, '<td valign="top">Too bad the lighting wasn''t at another angle to avoid most of this shot to be in shadows. Otherwise it is a very nicely composed photo which really conveys the motion of the water. Like the vertical lines created by the falling water.</td>', 'Too bad the lighting wasn''t at another angle to avoid most of this shot to be in shadows. Otherwise it is a very nicely composed photo which really conveys the motion of the water. Like the vertical lines created by the falling water.', '2002-12-13 23:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(171895, 9549, 4186, '<td valign="top">a shorter exposure and a larger aperature might have worked a little better. i think it might have been better with the spokes a little more distinct, but imagine this is more or less the effect you wanted. the composition is great. good contrast of form and void. keeping it to one basic color worked well too. 8</td>', 'a shorter exposure and a larger aperature might have worked a little better. i think it might have been better with the spokes a little more distinct, but imagine this is more or less the effect you wanted. the composition is great. good contrast of form and void. keeping it to one basic color worked well too. 8', '2002-12-13 23:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(171896, 9338, 4210, '<td valign="top">I love the colours in this one!</td>', 'I love the colours in this one!', '2002-12-14 00:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(171897, 9549, 4210, '<td valign="top">Great colour and composition!</td>', 'Great colour and composition!', '2002-12-14 00:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(171898, 9296, 4210, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition.</td>', 'Interesting composition.', '2002-12-14 00:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(171901, 9492, 4210, '<td valign="top">Seems like the camera was not perfectly parallel to the dominoes. Notice how the length from the edge of the photo to the dominoes becomes larger as it moves to the right. Just something to keep in mind for next time; I have a problem with it in all my photos. Good use of grayscale.</td>', 'Seems like the camera was not perfectly parallel to the dominoes. Notice how the length from the edge of the photo to the dominoes becomes larger as it moves to the right. Just something to keep in mind for next time; I have a problem with it in all my photos. Good use of grayscale.', '2002-12-14 00:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
