(171948, 9414, 933, '<td valign="top">A really nice photo. I like the contrast between the froxen and flowing water.  I think I''m bumping this up to an eight.  Good job!</td>', 'A really nice photo. I like the contrast between the froxen and flowing water.  I think I''m bumping this up to an eight.  Good job!', '2002-12-14 03:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
