(171951, 9533, 933, '<td valign="top">A fun, eentertaining photo.  You pulled the lighting off pretty well.  Not so sure about the cropping of the image, but it works ok I guess.  Nice job.</td>', 'A fun, eentertaining photo.  You pulled the lighting off pretty well.  Not so sure about the cropping of the image, but it works ok I guess.  Nice job.', '2002-12-14 03:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(171952, 9462, 2437, '<td valign="top">shutter was too fast.</td>', 'shutter was too fast.', '2002-12-14 03:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(171963, 9444, 2856, '<td valign="top">I personally think it''s a bit over exposed. I don''t like the hotspots in the waterfall, and the way the foam at the bottomleft looks. I also think that the exposure time is a bit too long so that the sense of motion is ruined (it almost looks like ice). The diagonal composition is a good thing, but still there isn''t enough to see to make this picture interesting.  Flowing water is not a very original subject so if you want to make an impresion you have to work hard(and succeed).<br/> <br/></td>', 'I personally think it''s a bit over exposed. I don''t like the hotspots in the waterfall, and the way the foam at the bottomleft looks. I also think that the exposure time is a bit too long so that the sense of motion is ruined (it almost looks like ice). The diagonal composition is a good thing, but still there isn''t enough to see to make this picture interesting.  Flowing water is not a very original subject so if you want to make an impresion you have to work hard(and succeed). ', '2002-12-14 05:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(171964, 9504, 2856, '<td valign="top">The tree is a bit overexposed but the cxomposition good.</td>', 'The tree is a bit overexposed but the cxomposition good.', '2002-12-14 05:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(171967, 9416, 2856, '<td valign="top">I bet you received about 40 comments about rotating your picture (I know all about it)</td>', 'I bet you received about 40 comments about rotating your picture (I know all about it)', '2002-12-14 05:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(171968, 9528, 4411, '<td valign="top">Great motion on this, fits the challenge perfectly.<br/>The line down the right hand side is very distracting though. Maybe this should have been cropped into a more squarish shape now that the rules allow it?<br/>Still a very good shot. Well done.</td>', 'Great motion on this, fits the challenge perfectly.The line down the right hand side is very distracting though. Maybe this should have been cropped into a more squarish shape now that the rules allow it?Still a very good shot. Well done.', '2002-12-14 05:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(171969, 9261, 4411, '<td valign="top">Wow. My favourite this week.<br/>The sense of motion &amp; speed I get looking at this is fantastic - the title fits perfectly.<br/>Well done &amp; good luck!</td>', 'Wow. My favourite this week.The sense of motion & speed I get looking at this is fantastic - the title fits perfectly.Well done & good luck!', '2002-12-14 05:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(171970, 9498, 4411, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured the perfect moment for the challenge. The contrast between the static and the moving players is great.  I think a close crop around the players may have made a better shot though - the background is too distracting.<br/>If you haven''t seen it already take a look at this forum thread to see what I mean ... //www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=9585</td>', 'You''ve captured the perfect moment for the challenge. The contrast between the static and the moving players is great.  I think a close crop around the players may have made a better shot though - the background is too distracting.If you haven''t seen it already take a look at this forum thread to see what I mean ... //www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&FORUM_THREAD_ID=9585', '2002-12-14 06:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(171971, 9300, 4411, '<td valign="top">A very nice photo, but doesn''t really scream motion to me.<br/>Whould have been nice if there was a blur trail on the ball - but you would have needed a lot more light for that.</td>', 'A very nice photo, but doesn''t really scream motion to me.Whould have been nice if there was a blur trail on the ball - but you would have needed a lot more light for that.', '2002-12-14 06:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
