(172033, 9302, 4615, '<td valign="top">The shadow is a strong point, and exven the glass reflection contributes tyo the impression of motion.  I still feel it needs more interest-some object, another car, a tree, something to look at.</td>', 'The shadow is a strong point, and exven the glass reflection contributes tyo the impression of motion.  I still feel it needs more interest-some object, another car, a tree, something to look at.', '2002-12-14 11:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
