(172038, 9527, 4615, '<td valign="top">The picture is pleasing to the eye, but I really want to know what it is.  I may be just a city boy, but I don''t see a moose here.</td>', 'The picture is pleasing to the eye, but I really want to know what it is.  I may be just a city boy, but I don''t see a moose here.', '2002-12-14 11:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
