(172074, 9366, 4514, '<td valign="top">1)Does the photo fit the Theme? (9)<br/>2)Color(7)<br/>3)Composition(8)<br/>4)Focus(8)<br/>5)Bacground(8)<br/>6)Lighting(7)<br/>7)Title(6)<br/> <br/>Overall Score: 7.57 rounded to 8<br/> <br/>Commentary:<br/>This shot is done very well.  I think the nail could have been straight.  The idea is just perfect.  The black background causes for the perfect amount of contrast here.  Wish I would have used a black background myself.  Wonderful shot<br/> <br/>John (TurboTech)</td>', '1)Does the photo fit the Theme? (9)2)Color(7)3)Composition(8)4)Focus(8)5)Bacground(8)6)Lighting(7)7)Title(6) Overall Score: 7.57 rounded to 8 Commentary:This shot is done very well.  I think the nail could have been straight.  The idea is just perfect.  The black background causes for the perfect amount of contrast here.  Wish I would have used a black background myself.  Wonderful shot John (TurboTech)', '2002-12-14 14:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(172076, 9489, 4514, '<td valign="top">1)Does the Photo Meet the Challenge?(8)<br/>2)Color(7)<br/>3)Composition(7)<br/>4)Focus(7)<br/>5)Background(8)<br/>6)Lighting(6)<br/>7)Title(8)<br/> <br/>Overall Score: 7.28 rounded to 7 <br/> <br/>This is a wonderful shot.  For the lighting that you had to work with, I think your colors turned out Nicely.  Is there any way for you to do custom white balance here.  If not then disregard.  It just has an unatrual Hue to the overall lighting.  Other than that great shot.</td>', '1)Does the Photo Meet the Challenge?(8)2)Color(7)3)Composition(7)4)Focus(7)5)Background(8)6)Lighting(6)7)Title(8) Overall Score: 7.28 rounded to 7  This is a wonderful shot.  For the lighting that you had to work with, I think your colors turned out Nicely.  Is there any way for you to do custom white balance here.  If not then disregard.  It just has an unatrual Hue to the overall lighting.  Other than that great shot.', '2002-12-14 14:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(172077, 9562, 4514, '<td valign="top">1)Does the Photo fit the Challenge?(5)<br/>2)Color(5)<br/>3)Composition(6)<br/>4)Focus(4)<br/>5)Background(5)<br/>6)Lighting(6)<br/>7)Title(6)<br/> <br/>Overall Score: (5.28 rounded to 5)<br/> <br/>Sorry to be harsh on the score.  I think there is a bit too much water here.  I am wondering what this would have looked like a little wider angle.  The composition is good.   For some reason it looks a bit Pixilated.  <br/> <br/>John (TurboTech)</td>', '1)Does the Photo fit the Challenge?(5)2)Color(5)3)Composition(6)4)Focus(4)5)Background(5)6)Lighting(6)7)Title(6) Overall Score: (5.28 rounded to 5) Sorry to be harsh on the score.  I think there is a bit too much water here.  I am wondering what this would have looked like a little wider angle.  The composition is good.   For some reason it looks a bit Pixilated.   John (TurboTech)', '2002-12-14 14:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(172079, 9268, 4514, '<td valign="top">1)Does the Photo fit the Theme? (5)<br/>2)Color(3)<br/>3)Composition(2)<br/>4)Focus(2)<br/>5)Background(4)<br/>6)Lighting(3)<br/>7)Title(4)<br/> <br/>Overall Score: (3.28 rounded to 3)<br/> <br/>There appears to be some stuff wrong with this photo.  Yes it depicts "Motion", but my oppinion is in a good Motion picture you have something that is still.  That helps the viewer take note that there is motion in the Photo.  That also helps to add an element of 3D to a 2 dimensional image.  This should be the main goal of a photographer.  Espeecially Landscapes.<br/>Overall Score.</td>', '1)Does the Photo fit the Theme? (5)2)Color(3)3)Composition(2)4)Focus(2)5)Background(4)6)Lighting(3)7)Title(4) Overall Score: (3.28 rounded to 3) There appears to be some stuff wrong with this photo.  Yes it depicts "Motion", but my oppinion is in a good Motion picture you have something that is still.  That helps the viewer take note that there is motion in the Photo.  That also helps to add an element of 3D to a 2 dimensional image.  This should be the main goal of a photographer.  Espeecially Landscapes.Overall Score.', '2002-12-14 14:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(172096, 9332, 5429, '<td valign="top">Good shot. Makes me feel like i''m actually there. I really shouldnt have had that last piece of pizza - i need to throw up.</td>', 'Good shot. Makes me feel like i''m actually there. I really shouldnt have had that last piece of pizza - i need to throw up.', '2002-12-14 17:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(172106, 9320, 4514, '<td valign="top">1)Does it fit the theme?(9)<br/>2)Color(7)<br/>3)composition(8)<br/>4)Focus(7)<br/>5)Background(8)<br/>6)Lighting(7)<br/>7)Title(7)<br/> <br/>Total Score:(7.57 rounded to 8.0)<br/> <br/>Commentary:<br/>The idea here is wonderful.  Exectution was great.  One thing wrong with this picture that I can see and I do not know if it is my monitor or not, but I think I can see pixels.  Other than that this is something i would hang on my wall.  Good job.<br/> <br/>John (TurboTech)</td>', '1)Does it fit the theme?(9)2)Color(7)3)composition(8)4)Focus(7)5)Background(8)6)Lighting(7)7)Title(7) Total Score:(7.57 rounded to 8.0) Commentary:The idea here is wonderful.  Exectution was great.  One thing wrong with this picture that I can see and I do not know if it is my monitor or not, but I think I can see pixels.  Other than that this is something i would hang on my wall.  Good job. John (TurboTech)', '2002-12-14 19:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(172107, 9303, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice photo showing good movement. I like the bright colours of the leaves but I think that a more topical backdrop would suit the image better. Would it be possible to pull this off outside? I''m not sure, but great photo anyway.</td>', 'Nice photo showing good movement. I like the bright colours of the leaves but I think that a more topical backdrop would suit the image better. Would it be possible to pull this off outside? I''m not sure, but great photo anyway.', '2002-12-14 19:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(172109, 9370, 4514, '<td valign="top">1)Does the photo fit the theme?(8)<br/>2)Color(7)<br/>3)Composition(7)<br/>4)Focus(5)<br/>5)Background(7)<br/>6)Lighting(6)<br/>7)Title(7)<br/> <br/>Overall Score:(6.71 rounded to 7)<br/> <br/>This is a great shot.  There are a few things that would make it better.  I think the focus is a little out.  That is understandable as I think I am Familiar with the method you used to set this up.  The light might be a little harsh.  From the reflection you have on the bottle of oil I can assume you used the on Cam flash.  I would personally put a sock over it and close the Apperture just a little more.  Just off to the left of the pan there is a yellow color.  Is this Egg Yolk or reflcetion of something.  Can not figure it out.  Anyway you have a great shot here.  <br/> <br/>John (TurboTech)</td>', '1)Does the photo fit the theme?(8)2)Color(7)3)Composition(7)4)Focus(5)5)Background(7)6)Lighting(6)7)Title(7) Overall Score:(6.71 rounded to 7) This is a great shot.  There are a few things that would make it better.  I think the focus is a little out.  That is understandable as I think I am Familiar with the method you used to set this up.  The light might be a little harsh.  From the reflection you have on the bottle of oil I can assume you used the on Cam flash.  I would personally put a sock over it and close the Apperture just a little more.  Just off to the left of the pan there is a yellow color.  Is this Egg Yolk or reflcetion of something.  Can not figure it out.  Anyway you have a great shot here.   John (TurboTech)', '2002-12-14 20:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(172112, 9509, 4210, '<td valign="top">Would have gone for a tighter crop of just the lights. The star and negative space is very distracting.</td>', 'Would have gone for a tighter crop of just the lights. The star and negative space is very distracting.', '2002-12-14 21:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(172113, 9579, 4210, '<td valign="top">Nice colours, composition.</td>', 'Nice colours, composition.', '2002-12-14 21:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(172114, 9468, 4210, '<td valign="top">I think this would be a more interesting photo if she were smiling.</td>', 'I think this would be a more interesting photo if she were smiling.', '2002-12-14 21:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(172115, 9328, 4210, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped closer, maybe have shot across the board and profiled the peices. And I think I can see your hand.... But a very interesting and innovative photo.</td>', 'I would have cropped closer, maybe have shot across the board and profiled the peices. And I think I can see your hand.... But a very interesting and innovative photo.', '2002-12-14 21:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(172116, 9408, 2480, '<td valign="top">Too bad the fence is in the way distracting from otherwise an excellent shot</td>', 'Too bad the fence is in the way distracting from otherwise an excellent shot', '2002-12-14 21:32:30.000000', NULL, 1);
