(172126, 9518, 4514, '<td valign="top">1)Does the photo fit the challenge?(6)<br/>2)Color(4)<br/>3)Composition(4)<br/>4)Focus(5)<br/>5)Background(6)<br/>6)Lighting(5)<br/>7)Title(4)<br/> <br/>Overall Score: (4.84 rounded to 5)<br/> <br/>Commentary:<br/>This has to be a difficult shot to set up.  considering the Blur you want and the speed the subject is moving.  Personally I would have tried to get the focal point more on the left to add more direction to the shot.  You did well at getting something in the shot that was not moving ie the trees in the background.  Overall you did a nice job.  <br/> <br/>John (TurboTech)</td>', '1)Does the photo fit the challenge?(6)2)Color(4)3)Composition(4)4)Focus(5)5)Background(6)6)Lighting(5)7)Title(4) Overall Score: (4.84 rounded to 5) Commentary:This has to be a difficult shot to set up.  considering the Blur you want and the speed the subject is moving.  Personally I would have tried to get the focal point more on the left to add more direction to the shot.  You did well at getting something in the shot that was not moving ie the trees in the background.  Overall you did a nice job.   John (TurboTech)', '2002-12-14 22:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
