(172150, 9557, 806, '<td valign="top">neat idea. slow down the shutter speed just a tad to show the moving ones in motion and the virtually still ones in the midst of the chaos.</td>', 'neat idea. slow down the shutter speed just a tad to show the moving ones in motion and the virtually still ones in the midst of the chaos.', '2002-12-14 23:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
