(172403, 9528, 806, '<td valign="top">Great use of motion, and this is elevated above others in that it also tells a story too many are familiar with! ;0)<br/>Great set up.. great tones...excellent use of imagination and imagery.</td>', 'Great use of motion, and this is elevated above others in that it also tells a story too many are familiar with! ;0)Great set up.. great tones...excellent use of imagination and imagery.', '2002-12-15 11:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(172404, 9518, 806, '<td valign="top">The scene is sharper than the figure... Since the subject seems to be the figure sledding down the hill, I''d like to see him/her in sharper focus with the background blurred to give the sense of motion</td>', 'The scene is sharper than the figure... Since the subject seems to be the figure sledding down the hill, I''d like to see him/her in sharper focus with the background blurred to give the sense of motion', '2002-12-15 12:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(172405, 9387, 806, '<td valign="top">good pan...</td>', 'good pan...', '2002-12-15 12:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(172406, 9487, 806, '<td valign="top">because the background is in sharper focus than the subject, it leads my eye to the big TEXAS word rather than the race car. My eye would rather not stay on the blurred object ... it seems too chaotic...</td>', 'because the background is in sharper focus than the subject, it leads my eye to the big TEXAS word rather than the race car. My eye would rather not stay on the blurred object ... it seems too chaotic...', '2002-12-15 12:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(172407, 9418, 806, '<td valign="top">This is marvelous.... A bit dim though. I wonder if it would lose too much detail if it were a tad brighter. The sweeping motion carries me away into the horizon.</td>', 'This is marvelous.... A bit dim though. I wonder if it would lose too much detail if it were a tad brighter. The sweeping motion carries me away into the horizon.', '2002-12-15 12:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
