(172442, 9397, 4514, '<td valign="top">1)Does the Photo fit the theme?(6)<br/>2)Color(5)<br/>3)Composition(6)<br/>4)Focus(5)<br/>5)Background(6)<br/>6)Lighting(5)<br/>7)Title(5)<br/> <br/>Overall Score:5.42 rounded to 5<br/> <br/>Commentary:<br/>I think John Cleese said it right.  "and now for something different"<br/>This is a decent job. I like this shot.  I think the lighting with the flash is a tad bit harsh.  Your motion is good and you blur is nice.  Personally I think the focus was a little weak.  I would not hang this print in my house, but with a little tweak I could see this as an album cover.  Good shot.<br/> <br/>John (TurboTech)</td>', '1)Does the Photo fit the theme?(6)2)Color(5)3)Composition(6)4)Focus(5)5)Background(6)6)Lighting(5)7)Title(5) Overall Score:5.42 rounded to 5 Commentary:I think John Cleese said it right.  "and now for something different"This is a decent job. I like this shot.  I think the lighting with the flash is a tad bit harsh.  Your motion is good and you blur is nice.  Personally I think the focus was a little weak.  I would not hang this print in my house, but with a little tweak I could see this as an album cover.  Good shot. John (TurboTech)', '2002-12-15 14:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(172444, 9303, 1031, '<td valign="top">Well captued motion nd a nice combination of colors, but it seems a little sterile. I rather see the solid background with a "still" life, or the leaf falling in a more naural setting.</td>', 'Well captued motion nd a nice combination of colors, but it seems a little sterile. I rather see the solid background with a "still" life, or the leaf falling in a more naural setting.', '2002-12-15 14:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(172447, 9474, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice range of tones, composition leads the eye across the image. NOT trying to freeze the water helps in the context of this challenge.</td>', 'Nice range of tones, composition leads the eye across the image. NOT trying to freeze the water helps in the context of this challenge.', '2002-12-15 14:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(172449, 9442, 4514, '<td valign="top">1)Does the Photo fit the theme?(3)<br/>2)Color(4)<br/>3)Composition(4)<br/>4)Focus(3)<br/>5)Background(3)<br/>6)Lighting(4)<br/>7)Title(4)<br/> <br/>Overall Score:3.57 rounded to 4<br/> <br/>Commentary:<br/>Focus here goes without saying.  I think that you had an opportunity for a good shot.  Personally, and this is my oppinion, I feel that the focal point is not worthy for a motion challenge.  I am not saying that the Idea is bad.  Not just one I would have experimented with.  I think with a little bit ofe tweaking and a different theme in mind you could turn this bad boy into a postcard.  Is there a Lighthouse on the other side of this grass.  Now that would be a nice shot.  Pull back a bit to expose a lighthouse behind the grass.  <br/> <br/>John (TurboTech)</td>', '1)Does the Photo fit the theme?(3)2)Color(4)3)Composition(4)4)Focus(3)5)Background(3)6)Lighting(4)7)Title(4) Overall Score:3.57 rounded to 4 Commentary:Focus here goes without saying.  I think that you had an opportunity for a good shot.  Personally, and this is my oppinion, I feel that the focal point is not worthy for a motion challenge.  I am not saying that the Idea is bad.  Not just one I would have experimented with.  I think with a little bit ofe tweaking and a different theme in mind you could turn this bad boy into a postcard.  Is there a Lighthouse on the other side of this grass.  Now that would be a nice shot.  Pull back a bit to expose a lighthouse behind the grass.   John (TurboTech)', '2002-12-15 14:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(172450, 9416, 1031, '<td valign="top">Would have helps had the person in the background were still behind the tree, helping isolate your subject. I''m a little confused how it can me both a "stranger" AND a "part of  me."  Would also have been easier to evaluate if it had been rotated into the vertical orientation.</td>', 'Would have helps had the person in the background were still behind the tree, helping isolate your subject. I''m a little confused how it can me both a "stranger" AND a "part of  me."  Would also have been easier to evaluate if it had been rotated into the vertical orientation.', '2002-12-15 14:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(172451, 9435, 1379, '<td valign="top">So good!</td>', 'So good!', '2002-12-15 14:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(172452, 9349, 1379, '<td valign="top">What a magazine-quality photo!  Such a beautiful animal, and nicely accented by the green needles on the right.</td>', 'What a magazine-quality photo!  Such a beautiful animal, and nicely accented by the green needles on the right.', '2002-12-15 14:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(172453, 9554, 4514, '<td valign="top">1)Does the Photo fit the theme?(5)<br/>2)Color(5)<br/>3)Composition(6)<br/>4)Focus(5)<br/>5)Background(6)<br/>6)Lighting(5)<br/>7)Title(4)<br/> <br/>Overall Score:5.14 rounded to 5<br/> <br/>Commentary:<br/>Personally I feel there is something missing here.  I think the picture itself would have fared better with more picture on the left side than the right.  It gives a better sense of direction and in turn fits the theme of the challenge a tad bit more.  Now was there anything that could have been  caught in the background that would have given us a nice blur when the chopper is passing it.  I just feel that there is a lacking element.  I had several shots just like this one that I was thinking about for this challenge, so I know how hard it is to get a shot like this.  <br/> <br/>John (TurboTech)</td>', '1)Does the Photo fit the theme?(5)2)Color(5)3)Composition(6)4)Focus(5)5)Background(6)6)Lighting(5)7)Title(4) Overall Score:5.14 rounded to 5 Commentary:Personally I feel there is something missing here.  I think the picture itself would have fared better with more picture on the left side than the right.  It gives a better sense of direction and in turn fits the theme of the challenge a tad bit more.  Now was there anything that could have been  caught in the background that would have given us a nice blur when the chopper is passing it.  I just feel that there is a lacking element.  I had several shots just like this one that I was thinking about for this challenge, so I know how hard it is to get a shot like this.   John (TurboTech)', '2002-12-15 14:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(172454, 9391, 1379, '<td valign="top">Ravers, unite!</td>', 'Ravers, unite!', '2002-12-15 14:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(172455, 9314, 1031, '<td valign="top">A little overexposed on the face, but captures the energy of the moment. Wish the singer''s mouth was visible on the other side of the mic. I would crop from the right to where the shadow and cable meet the guitar neck, about the to singer''s left shoulder, to bring more focus/attention to your subject, eliminating the head of the bass and the large distracting shadow on the back wall.</td>', 'A little overexposed on the face, but captures the energy of the moment. Wish the singer''s mouth was visible on the other side of the mic. I would crop from the right to where the shadow and cable meet the guitar neck, about the to singer''s left shoulder, to bring more focus/attention to your subject, eliminating the head of the bass and the large distracting shadow on the back wall.', '2002-12-15 14:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(172456, 9393, 1031, '<td valign="top">Lighting is understandably a bit harsh; good use of non-standard cropping ratio.</td>', 'Lighting is understandably a bit harsh; good use of non-standard cropping ratio.', '2002-12-15 14:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(172457, 9572, 4514, '<td valign="top">1)Does the Photo fit the theme?(3)<br/>2)Color(5)<br/>3)Composition(4)<br/>4)Focus(5)<br/>5)Background(4)<br/>6)Lighting(4)<br/>7)Title(5)<br/> <br/>Overall Score:4.28 rounded to 4<br/> <br/>Commentary:<br/>I do not feel in my oppinion that this picture portrays motion that well.<br/>The background is a bit low key as far as its purpose for this shot.<br/>I am surprised with all the snow that you could not get a good bounce of light into the Darker dogs face.  That would have set up a better looking shot.  Appears to me that the wrong dog is wearing the harness.<br/> <br/>John (TurboTech)</td>', '1)Does the Photo fit the theme?(3)2)Color(5)3)Composition(4)4)Focus(5)5)Background(4)6)Lighting(4)7)Title(5) Overall Score:4.28 rounded to 4 Commentary:I do not feel in my oppinion that this picture portrays motion that well.The background is a bit low key as far as its purpose for this shot.I am surprised with all the snow that you could not get a good bounce of light into the Darker dogs face.  That would have set up a better looking shot.  Appears to me that the wrong dog is wearing the harness. John (TurboTech)', '2002-12-15 14:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(172458, 9427, 1031, '<td valign="top">Good choice of subject with occilating motion.</td>', 'Good choice of subject with occilating motion.', '2002-12-15 14:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(172459, 9516, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice job capturing both motion and stillness -- I suspect it was a tricky lighting and exposure job. Certainly puts a new spin on belly dancing!</td>', 'Nice job capturing both motion and stillness -- I suspect it was a tricky lighting and exposure job. Certainly puts a new spin on belly dancing!', '2002-12-15 14:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(172461, 9490, 4514, '<td valign="top">1)Does the Photo fit the theme?(6)<br/>2)Color(5)<br/>3)Composition(5)<br/>4)Focus(5)<br/>5)Background(5)<br/>6)Lighting(5)<br/>7)Title(4)<br/> <br/>Overall Score:5<br/> <br/>Commentary:<br/>I think this shot has good intentions.  There are certain things that I do not agree with, but that may go along with personal oppinions.  It is just a shame that the people swinging the fire or lights were not a little more still while swinging.  To me that adds a bit of visual unsatisfaction so to speak.  The towns people are a choice.  They show that there is intrest in what is going on in the picture.  I think it would have fared better to get the top of the thing the front guy is twirling.<br/> <br/>John (TurboTech)</td>', '1)Does the Photo fit the theme?(6)2)Color(5)3)Composition(5)4)Focus(5)5)Background(5)6)Lighting(5)7)Title(4) Overall Score:5 Commentary:I think this shot has good intentions.  There are certain things that I do not agree with, but that may go along with personal oppinions.  It is just a shame that the people swinging the fire or lights were not a little more still while swinging.  To me that adds a bit of visual unsatisfaction so to speak.  The towns people are a choice.  They show that there is intrest in what is going on in the picture.  I think it would have fared better to get the top of the thing the front guy is twirling. John (TurboTech)', '2002-12-15 14:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(172463, 9382, 4514, '<td valign="top">1)Does the Photo fit the theme?(5)<br/>2)Color(4)<br/>3)Composition(5)<br/>4)Focus(4)<br/>5)Background(5)<br/>6)Lighting(4)<br/>7)Title(5)<br/> <br/>Overall Score:4.57 rounded to 5.00<br/> <br/>Commentary:<br/>I think what actually hurt this photo was the light.  It subtracts the from the focus.  It is possible that had this been a little lighter I would have been able to judge the focus better.  That is really all I can comment about.  Is this Colorado?  If so I have been there.</td>', '1)Does the Photo fit the theme?(5)2)Color(4)3)Composition(5)4)Focus(4)5)Background(5)6)Lighting(4)7)Title(5) Overall Score:4.57 rounded to 5.00 Commentary:I think what actually hurt this photo was the light.  It subtracts the from the focus.  It is possible that had this been a little lighter I would have been able to judge the focus better.  That is really all I can comment about.  Is this Colorado?  If so I have been there.', '2002-12-15 15:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(172466, 9300, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice unusul angle; for this challenge a little straking behind theball would help.</td>', 'Nice unusul angle; for this challenge a little straking behind theball would help.', '2002-12-15 15:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(172467, 9554, 1031, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately whre I live most of the nearby chopper flights are Medi-Vac flights to the hospital...Nice job getting a clear shot with a long lens.</td>', 'Unfortunately whre I live most of the nearby chopper flights are Medi-Vac flights to the hospital...Nice job getting a clear shot with a long lens.', '2002-12-15 15:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(172468, 9478, 1031, '<td valign="top">Very funny and seasonal.</td>', 'Very funny and seasonal.', '2002-12-15 15:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(172470, 9435, 1031, '<td valign="top">Background could have been steadier to make the train stand out better, but probably hard to do under ambient lighting.<br/>(ADDED)<br/>Well, I guess you can''t be much steadier than that for 2 seconds! Good job!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2002-12-16 03:12:27.</i></td>', 'Background could have been steadier to make the train stand out better, but probably hard to do under ambient lighting.(ADDED)Well, I guess you can''t be much steadier than that for 2 seconds! Good job!', '2002-12-15 15:19:00.000000', '2002-12-16 03:12:27.000000', 1),
(172473, 9576, 1031, '<td valign="top">Just a bit too blurry for my taste.</td>', 'Just a bit too blurry for my taste.', '2002-12-15 15:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(172474, 9371, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice job capturing an unusual pose...seeing the feet at the end of their stroke helps convey sense of motion.</td>', 'Nice job capturing an unusual pose...seeing the feet at the end of their stroke helps convey sense of motion.', '2002-12-15 15:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(172475, 9347, 1031, '<td valign="top">Pretty good motion pan. Looks like the car might be on  downslope; if not, I''d have straigtened it as most folks seem to find the slant distracting.</td>', 'Pretty good motion pan. Looks like the car might be on  downslope; if not, I''d have straigtened it as most folks seem to find the slant distracting.', '2002-12-15 15:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(172476, 9261, 4430, '<td valign="top">I really like how the trees, and the white line on the road came out in this.</td>', 'I really like how the trees, and the white line on the road came out in this.', '2002-12-15 15:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
