(172531, 9326, 4514, '<td valign="top">I do not think the engine was on.  There is no way you could keep the focus of this engine when you open it up like you did.  This thing would be shakin like a Tikle me Elmo.   Nice Job.</td>', 'I do not think the engine was on.  There is no way you could keep the focus of this engine when you open it up like you did.  This thing would be shakin like a Tikle me Elmo.   Nice Job.', '2002-12-15 16:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
