(172592, 9321, 4596, '<td valign="top">Very colourful. Was there anything special about the timing to get this effect? Nice. There is a certain smoothness to it.</td>', 'Very colourful. Was there anything special about the timing to get this effect? Nice. There is a certain smoothness to it.', '2002-12-15 17:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
