(172603, 9261, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a great capture of motion.. I think this is my favorite shot in this challenge... great work :) = 10 - setzler</td>', 'This is a great capture of motion.. I think this is my favorite shot in this challenge... great work :) = 10 - setzler', '2002-12-15 17:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(172605, 9269, 772, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorite shots in this challenge... This looks like rear curtain sync flash and it did a wonderful job lighting up the reflective back of this train... good work :) = 10 - setzler</td>', 'This is one of my favorite shots in this challenge... This looks like rear curtain sync flash and it did a wonderful job lighting up the reflective back of this train... good work :) = 10 - setzler', '2002-12-15 17:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(172607, 9517, 772, '<td valign="top">great shot :)  I think it would be slightly stronger with the flag pole showing, but i''m still giving this a 10... stopped motion it may be, but motion is still dominating this image... great work :) - setzler</td>', 'great shot :)  I think it would be slightly stronger with the flag pole showing, but i''m still giving this a 10... stopped motion it may be, but motion is still dominating this image... great work :) - setzler', '2002-12-15 17:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(172611, 9332, 1031, '<td valign="top">Good use of playground equipment. Might have been even more dramatic with a longer exposure/more blur, but hard to know where to draw the line...</td>', 'Good use of playground equipment. Might have been even more dramatic with a longer exposure/more blur, but hard to know where to draw the line...', '2002-12-15 18:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(172613, 9407, 1031, '<td valign="top">Looks awfully close to those power lines...</td>', 'Looks awfully close to those power lines...', '2002-12-15 18:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(172620, 9555, 1031, '<td valign="top">I''d try this from a different (higher?) angle so you don''t have the visible seam where the foreground surface meets the back "wall," splitting the final image of the bulb. I like the overall concept.</td>', 'I''d try this from a different (higher?) angle so you don''t have the visible seam where the foreground surface meets the back "wall," splitting the final image of the bulb. I like the overall concept.', '2002-12-15 18:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(172624, 9499, 1031, '<td valign="top">Unique sequence of stop-action captures -- I suspect this was trickier than it looks, or else used trickery I don''t notice...How long did you have to wait between throws?</td>', 'Unique sequence of stop-action captures -- I suspect this was trickier than it looks, or else used trickery I don''t notice...How long did you have to wait between throws?', '2002-12-15 18:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(172625, 9352, 1031, '<td valign="top">I think this would look better with softer lighting and letting the pendulum blur.</td>', 'I think this would look better with softer lighting and letting the pendulum blur.', '2002-12-15 18:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(172626, 9498, 1031, '<td valign="top">Don''t think you need so much bakground -- I''d crop tighter to the group of running players, maybe a vertical cr if you really want to include the logo.</td>', 'Don''t think you need so much bakground -- I''d crop tighter to the group of running players, maybe a vertical cr if you really want to include the logo.', '2002-12-15 18:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(172627, 9533, 4514, '<td valign="top">Hey I think we have a Geroge Lucas in the crowd.</td>', 'Hey I think we have a Geroge Lucas in the crowd.', '2002-12-15 18:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(172629, 9277, 4514, '<td valign="top">Kinda pushin it close on a sunday night to meet the challange deadline huh???  LOL</td>', 'Kinda pushin it close on a sunday night to meet the challange deadline huh???  LOL', '2002-12-15 18:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(172631, 9349, 4514, '<td valign="top">This is an awsome shot.  Not for this challange though.</td>', 'This is an awsome shot.  Not for this challange though.', '2002-12-15 18:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(172632, 9466, 5687, '<td valign="top">Nice photo</td>', 'Nice photo', '2002-12-15 18:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(172633, 9409, 2221, '<td valign="top">Great motion photo! I wanted to do a similar shot for the challenge (panning the camera) but none of my tries were as good as yours. The subject could still could be a bit sharper but I know how difficult that is. I like that the white colour of the car matches colour of the snow in the background. -stephan</td>', 'Great motion photo! I wanted to do a similar shot for the challenge (panning the camera) but none of my tries were as good as yours. The subject could still could be a bit sharper but I know how difficult that is. I like that the white colour of the car matches colour of the snow in the background. -stephan', '2002-12-15 19:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(172636, 9474, 5687, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2002-12-15 19:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(172638, 9435, 2221, '<td valign="top">I like the colours and that you can look inside the train. I also like that can make out some detailt there and that it''s not everything blurred. The backgorund and the platform could be a it sharper but I guess the camera was handheld. I submitted a similar photo this week and I know how difficult it is. I like your composition because it gives a nice sense of depth. -stephan</td>', 'I like the colours and that you can look inside the train. I also like that can make out some detailt there and that it''s not everything blurred. The backgorund and the platform could be a it sharper but I guess the camera was handheld. I submitted a similar photo this week and I know how difficult it is. I like your composition because it gives a nice sense of depth. -stephan', '2002-12-15 19:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(172640, 9446, 2221, '<td valign="top">I like your concept. The contrast between the woman standing still and the carousel in motion is nice. Unfortunately the carousel itself is not so nice. In my opinion the motion blur is a tad too much. A slightly faster shutter would be better. It looks very wild because almost everything is in motion. I would like some parts being still and giving the eye some rest. -stephan</td>', 'I like your concept. The contrast between the woman standing still and the carousel in motion is nice. Unfortunately the carousel itself is not so nice. In my opinion the motion blur is a tad too much. A slightly faster shutter would be better. It looks very wild because almost everything is in motion. I would like some parts being still and giving the eye some rest. -stephan', '2002-12-15 19:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(172641, 9274, 2221, '<td valign="top">Yeah, this photo really has a wow factor. And because I love lighting effects you score pretty high on my scale ;-) I''m interested in the details how you did this. Did you move your camera during the exposure? Is your camera able to zoom in while the shutter is open? Please make sure to include some information on your photo. I''ll get back onyour photo after the challenge. -stephan</td>', 'Yeah, this photo really has a wow factor. And because I love lighting effects you score pretty high on my scale ;-) I''m interested in the details how you did this. Did you move your camera during the exposure? Is your camera able to zoom in while the shutter is open? Please make sure to include some information on your photo. I''ll get back onyour photo after the challenge. -stephan', '2002-12-15 19:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(172642, 9416, 2567, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but it really needs to be upright.  Then I would have cropped the red in the bottom left side off.  It is distracting.</td>', 'Nice shot but it really needs to be upright.  Then I would have cropped the red in the bottom left side off.  It is distracting.', '2002-12-15 19:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(172643, 9560, 2221, '<td valign="top">I like your photo. Maybe some people will complain that there is nothing in focus but actually that what I like ;-) There is enough detail to see that it''s a kid running around and just like kids are everything is a bit wild and chaotic. I think this works good here. It was probably coincidence but I like that the child was right before the black part of the background when you shot the photo. This gives a good contrast between subject and background. The photo wouldn''t look so good otherwise because then the child would have merged with the background. -stephan</td>', 'I like your photo. Maybe some people will complain that there is nothing in focus but actually that what I like ;-) There is enough detail to see that it''s a kid running around and just like kids are everything is a bit wild and chaotic. I think this works good here. It was probably coincidence but I like that the child was right before the black part of the background when you shot the photo. This gives a good contrast between subject and background. The photo wouldn''t look so good otherwise because then the child would have merged with the background. -stephan', '2002-12-15 19:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(172644, 9261, 2221, '<td valign="top">The title fits perfectly. This is one of my favourite photos this week. Conveys motion perfectly. -stephan</td>', 'The title fits perfectly. This is one of my favourite photos this week. Conveys motion perfectly. -stephan', '2002-12-15 19:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(172646, 9279, 2221, '<td valign="top">Hmm... a very different take on the challenge. Creative! The photo could be a bit better technically. E.g. I would have cropped out the upper part and maybe shot from a more direct angle. The lighting is a bit weak also but I think you couldn''t setup an array of lamps in the middle of the street. ;-) But I think you fulfilled the challenge perfectly. -stephan<br/></td>', 'Hmm... a very different take on the challenge. Creative! The photo could be a bit better technically. E.g. I would have cropped out the upper part and maybe shot from a more direct angle. The lighting is a bit weak also but I think you couldn''t setup an array of lamps in the middle of the street. ;-) But I think you fulfilled the challenge perfectly. -stephan', '2002-12-15 19:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(172647, 9399, 2221, '<td valign="top">Wow! Cool effect. It''s a bit overexposured but very creative. Also fulfills the challenge in a different way. I like the photo. -stephan</td>', 'Wow! Cool effect. It''s a bit overexposured but very creative. Also fulfills the challenge in a different way. I like the photo. -stephan', '2002-12-15 19:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(172648, 9453, 2221, '<td valign="top">I like the panning effect. You did a good job with that. I know how difficult it is to get the subject sharp. -stephan</td>', 'I like the panning effect. You did a good job with that. I know how difficult it is to get the subject sharp. -stephan', '2002-12-15 19:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(172650, 9525, 2221, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photo. You did a good job with the motion blur of the water. I also love the lighting and the colour tone. -stephan</td>', 'This is a beautiful photo. You did a good job with the motion blur of the water. I also love the lighting and the colour tone. -stephan', '2002-12-15 19:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(172652, 9533, 2221, '<td valign="top">Very funny! I''m a big Star Wars fan so you get an extra point from me ;-) You did a good job aligning the TIE fighter exactly to the "laser" strokes of light. I don''t like the tight crop especially in the lower half of the photo. -stephan</td>', 'Very funny! I''m a big Star Wars fan so you get an extra point from me ;-) You did a good job aligning the TIE fighter exactly to the "laser" strokes of light. I don''t like the tight crop especially in the lower half of the photo. -stephan', '2002-12-15 19:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(172653, 9555, 2221, '<td valign="top">Very creative shot! Black&amp;white works very good here. The only thing which bothers me is that the photo is so tilted. -stephan</td>', 'Very creative shot! Black&white works very good here. The only thing which bothers me is that the photo is so tilted. -stephan', '2002-12-15 19:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(172655, 9508, 2567, '<td valign="top">Fabulous shot.</td>', 'Fabulous shot.', '2002-12-15 19:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(172657, 9557, 2567, '<td valign="top">Sorry really don''t see any motion here.  Looks more like a still life.</td>', 'Sorry really don''t see any motion here.  Looks more like a still life.', '2002-12-15 19:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(172663, 9332, 3859, '<td valign="top">What a great idea for motion!</td>', 'What a great idea for motion!', '2002-12-15 20:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(172664, 9267, 1570, '<td valign="top">i do like the visible "motion" of the waves, but the front of the composition doesn''t interest me... also, it would''ve been better if the line of the horizon was straight...</td>', 'i do like the visible "motion" of the waves, but the front of the composition doesn''t interest me... also, it would''ve been better if the line of the horizon was straight...', '2002-12-15 20:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(172665, 9348, 1570, '<td valign="top">too fuzzy...</td>', 'too fuzzy...', '2002-12-15 20:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(172670, 9548, 4007, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the negative effect works well with this shot. 2</td>', 'I don''t think the negative effect works well with this shot. 2', '2002-12-15 21:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(172673, 9529, 4007, '<td valign="top">The skin color appears rather blotchy (too much saturation tweaking?), and her eyes don''t come through well, which I think hurts the shot.  I like how her body divides the black left upper and the bluish blur on the bottom right.  I like the bluish blur, but it''s a little to thick, or seems overdone somehow and ends up detracting from the shot.  Good concept but the execution falls a little short. 3</td>', 'The skin color appears rather blotchy (too much saturation tweaking?), and her eyes don''t come through well, which I think hurts the shot.  I like how her body divides the black left upper and the bluish blur on the bottom right.  I like the bluish blur, but it''s a little to thick, or seems overdone somehow and ends up detracting from the shot.  Good concept but the execution falls a little short. 3', '2002-12-15 21:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(172676, 9277, 4007, '<td valign="top">I''d either tighten the crop on top to come right to the edge of the clock, or give a little bit of space between the clock and the edge of the frame at the bottom.  In fact, a closer view, perhaps only showing half or a fourth of the clock might have added to the snese of motion and overall uniqueness of the shot.  I like the lighting and the white clock on black backdrop.  Overall nice shot.  6</td>', 'I''d either tighten the crop on top to come right to the edge of the clock, or give a little bit of space between the clock and the edge of the frame at the bottom.  In fact, a closer view, perhaps only showing half or a fourth of the clock might have added to the snese of motion and overall uniqueness of the shot.  I like the lighting and the white clock on black backdrop.  Overall nice shot.  6', '2002-12-15 21:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(172678, 9408, 4007, '<td valign="top">The colors in this shot are great.  I love the green tones with the spike of blue down the middle and the blue haze hanging over.  Great framing and neat shot.  Must have been beautiful to see first hand. 7</td>', 'The colors in this shot are great.  I love the green tones with the spike of blue down the middle and the blue haze hanging over.  Great framing and neat shot.  Must have been beautiful to see first hand. 7', '2002-12-15 21:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(172683, 9352, 4007, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the framing of this shot.  The clock is centered horizontally yet fills only the middle third of the frame.  Vertically the top  of the clock is cut off.  Taking this shot with a portrait orientation might have been a good idea, or else an off center subject placement might have helped.  This shot still needs something else to give it some oomf though, as it currently comes off as a rather dull shot.  A unique angle, framing, or close up could all help create a less generic appearance. 2</td>', 'I don''t understand the framing of this shot.  The clock is centered horizontally yet fills only the middle third of the frame.  Vertically the top  of the clock is cut off.  Taking this shot with a portrait orientation might have been a good idea, or else an off center subject placement might have helped.  This shot still needs something else to give it some oomf though, as it currently comes off as a rather dull shot.  A unique angle, framing, or close up could all help create a less generic appearance. 2', '2002-12-15 21:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(172684, 9472, 4007, '<td valign="top">The two frames of motion you''re forming here each look rather blurry, which detracts from the shot.  A darker backdrop and clearer light source might have helped make this shot stand out more. 3</td>', 'The two frames of motion you''re forming here each look rather blurry, which detracts from the shot.  A darker backdrop and clearer light source might have helped make this shot stand out more. 3', '2002-12-15 21:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(172685, 9348, 4007, '<td valign="top">The motion blur doesn''t seem to add to this shot.  It looks just like blurryness caused by a shaky hand. 2</td>', 'The motion blur doesn''t seem to add to this shot.  It looks just like blurryness caused by a shaky hand. 2', '2002-12-15 21:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(172721, 9267, 843, '<td valign="top">I like the forground, but I would level the horizon.</td>', 'I like the forground, but I would level the horizon.', '2002-12-15 22:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(172724, 9332, 4186, '<td valign="top">very good concept. very good execution. i would have left it just a little longer, but the effect is great. 7</td>', 'very good concept. very good execution. i would have left it just a little longer, but the effect is great. 7', '2002-12-15 22:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(172725, 9277, 843, '<td valign="top">The clock is a little off center. Good idea, though</td>', 'The clock is a little off center. Good idea, though', '2002-12-15 22:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
