(172764, 9484, 3419, '<td valign="top">The picture would work better without the mirror on the left (including the reflected lamp) and the dresser/blanket on the right. Both of these elements distract. The light source also creates a flaring which I find distracting.</td>', 'The picture would work better without the mirror on the left (including the reflected lamp) and the dresser/blanket on the right. Both of these elements distract. The light source also creates a flaring which I find distracting.', '2002-12-15 23:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(172765, 9294, 5677, '<td valign="top">I love how it goes from blurry to sharp just as the dominoes would fall.  I imagine it took a lot of timing to get this just right.  Good job.</td>', 'I love how it goes from blurry to sharp just as the dominoes would fall.  I imagine it took a lot of timing to get this just right.  Good job.', '2002-12-15 23:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
