(173082, 9446, 5121, '<td valign="top">I thought this one would''ve got a lot higher up in the ratings. Thanks for all the great comments anyway...and special thanks to the guy who was "TOO BUSY" to depress the caps lock key!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2002-12-16 07:26:16.</i></td>', 'I thought this one would''ve got a lot higher up in the ratings. Thanks for all the great comments anyway...and special thanks to the guy who was "TOO BUSY" to depress the caps lock key!', '2002-12-16 03:20:02.000000', '2002-12-16 07:26:16.000000', 0),
