(173134, 9307, 5158, '<td valign="top">Thanx for all the kind comments!<br/>My best running submission so far! Yuhu!!<br/>To jgillard:<br/>You are absolutely right regarding the strings on loosing on the fretboard: I worked long on that issue but could not manage to get them better seen. When I moved the light closer to the strings, interior of the guitar was visible through the hole. That didn''t look good at all.<br/> <br/> <br/> <br/></td>', 'Thanx for all the kind comments!My best running submission so far! Yuhu!!To jgillard:You are absolutely right regarding the strings on loosing on the fretboard: I worked long on that issue but could not manage to get them better seen. When I moved the light closer to the strings, interior of the guitar was visible through the hole. That didn''t look good at all.   ', '2002-12-16 05:27:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(173151, 9520, 2716, '<td valign="top">Mommy, Mommy, they gave another purty ribbon :)  <br/> <br/>Wow, thanks guys for the generous votes and comments, again. I''ll try to post one of those "How''d they do that" things later this week.  My little "invention" (see my Photographer''s comments) is really fun to work with.<br/> <br/>I''ll also post a link to some more varations of my shot here.    <br/> <br/>Gotta go work.  Nice way to start my week.  Lol</td>', 'Mommy, Mommy, they gave another purty ribbon :)   Wow, thanks guys for the generous votes and comments, again. I''ll try to post one of those "How''d they do that" things later this week.  My little "invention" (see my Photographer''s comments) is really fun to work with. I''ll also post a link to some more varations of my shot here.     Gotta go work.  Nice way to start my week.  Lol', '2002-12-16 06:35:13.000000', NULL, 0),
