(173192, 9489, 2221, '<td valign="top">Chrysalis got it perfectly right. That''s what I wanted to show. I thought I could increase the impact of the motion blur and the speed it represents by placing it in contrast to the wall. I think it worked.<br/> <br/>I don''t remember exactly what white balance setting I used but I remember that I set it so that the lighting is a bit warmer. The lamps produce a slightly reddish light but I liked that in this case because the yellow of the subway came out quite nicely.<br/></td>', 'Chrysalis got it perfectly right. That''s what I wanted to show. I thought I could increase the impact of the motion blur and the speed it represents by placing it in contrast to the wall. I think it worked. I don''t remember exactly what white balance setting I used but I remember that I set it so that the lighting is a bit warmer. The lamps produce a slightly reddish light but I liked that in this case because the yellow of the subway came out quite nicely.', '2002-12-16 08:23:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(173209, 9520, 3102, '<td valign="top">Interesting explanation -- I really thought you used a strobe light here... very cool!  Congrats on 1st!!</td>', 'Interesting explanation -- I really thought you used a strobe light here... very cool!  Congrats on 1st!!', '2002-12-16 09:04:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(173224, 9563, 772, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the critique Club :)<br/> <br/>Gracious,<br/> <br/>The capture of motion here is nice, but the image quality is lacking.  You did not include your camera settings for this shot, so I can''t really comment on how they affected the outcome of the image.  It looks like high iso probably..<br/> <br/>Compositionally, I would have tried to include the feet of the girl in the foreground.  "Marching" is the theme of this shot and the feet that are doing this marching are cut off in the bottom of the frame.  <br/> <br/>Shots like this one are difficult for sure :)<br/> <br/>John Setzler<br/></td>', 'Greetings from the critique Club :) Gracious, The capture of motion here is nice, but the image quality is lacking.  You did not include your camera settings for this shot, so I can''t really comment on how they affected the outcome of the image.  It looks like high iso probably.. Compositionally, I would have tried to include the feet of the girl in the foreground.  "Marching" is the theme of this shot and the feet that are doing this marching are cut off in the bottom of the frame.   Shots like this one are difficult for sure :) John Setzler', '2002-12-16 09:52:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(173225, 9360, 3102, '<td valign="top">Woo hoo!  Thanks for the kind words and votes!  By the way, there was no star filter involved here... that''s just the way it turned out.  :)</td>', 'Woo hoo!  Thanks for the kind words and votes!  By the way, there was no star filter involved here... that''s just the way it turned out.  :)', '2002-12-16 09:55:23.000000', NULL, 0),
