(418074, 9414, 3032, '<td valign="top">The FDR memorial is one of the most beautiful memorials I have ever seen. I was fortunate to visit it at night, the atmosphere was amazing. Washington at its best.</td>', 'The FDR memorial is one of the most beautiful memorials I have ever seen. I was fortunate to visit it at night, the atmosphere was amazing. Washington at its best.', '2003-09-13 20:12:04.000000', NULL, 0),
