(607859, 9533, 15660, '<td valign="top">I was browsing old challenges and come across this<br/>picture! Damn, I love it!<br/>Im huge SW fan.<br/> <br/>But, there is this one thing that bugs me...<br/>Well you see... Tie Fightar can''t go into warp speed<br/>(light speed).<br/>But who the hell knows that anyway ;)<br/> <br/>Great photo! :) It would be 9 from me (-1 for light speed)<br/>he,he... :)<br/> <br/>Cheers!</td>', 'I was browsing old challenges and come across thispicture! Damn, I love it!Im huge SW fan. But, there is this one thing that bugs me...Well you see... Tie Fightar can''t go into warp speed(light speed).But who the hell knows that anyway ;) Great photo! :) It would be 9 from me (-1 for light speed)he,he... :) Cheers!', '2004-03-03 15:37:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(608588, 9533, 3018, '<td valign="top">Thanks for your comment, Amor E Morte.<br/>That''s a keen observation, about the TIE being unable to go to hyperspace.  Being also a SW fan, I do know that, but the TIE fighter is a highly recognizable icon from Star Wars.  So I still decided to do it.  Also, the TIE is way cooler than the XWing, visually.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Thanks for your comment, Amor E Morte.That''s a keen observation, about the TIE being unable to go to hyperspace.  Being also a SW fan, I do know that, but the TIE fighter is a highly recognizable icon from Star Wars.  So I still decided to do it.  Also, the TIE is way cooler than the XWing, visually. ', '2004-03-03 22:23:21.000000', NULL, 0),
